Fluent English (spoken&nbsp;and&nbsp;written).&nbsp;




Why join Volta Medical? 
Artificial Intelligence is transforming healthcare, and Volta Medical is at the forefront of this revolution.&nbsp;



Joining&nbsp;us&nbsp;means&nbsp;contributing&nbsp;to&nbsp;cutting-edge&nbsp;medical&nbsp;technologies&nbsp;that&nbsp;directly&nbsp;improve&nbsp;patients'&nbsp;lives&nbsp;while&nbsp;working&nbsp;alongside&nbsp;internationally&nbsp;recognized&nbsp;experts in&nbsp;electrophysiology, AI and&nbsp;medical&nbsp;devices.&nbsp;


At Volta,&nbsp;you&nbsp;will&nbsp;enjoy:&nbsp;




