High&nbsp;autonomy&nbsp;and&nbsp;opportunities&nbsp;for&nbsp;professional&nbsp;growth.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Regular&nbsp;scientific&nbsp;exchanges and innovation-driven&nbsp;culture.&nbsp;&nbsp;






A&nbsp;workplace&nbsp;located&nbsp;in Marseille,&nbsp;offering&nbsp;an&nbsp;exceptional&nbsp;Mediterranean&nbsp;lifestyle.&nbsp;




Volta Medical&nbsp;is an equal&nbsp;opportunity employer committed to diversity and inclusion. We encourage qualified&nbsp;individuals&nbsp;from all backgrounds to apply. If you are passionate about leveraging technology to make a positive impact on healthcare,&nbsp;we'd love to hear&nbsp;from&nbsp;you!&nbsp;

