Coffee chat at our Marseille HQ (120 min)&nbsp;Spend&nbsp;time&nbsp;with&nbsp;the Data Science&nbsp;team,&nbsp;our&nbsp;Chief&nbsp;Clinical&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Regulatory&nbsp;Officer, and&nbsp;our&nbsp;Co-founders&nbsp;(Julien/Clément). Discover&nbsp;our&nbsp;working&nbsp;environment, exchange&nbsp;ideas, and&nbsp;get&nbsp;a&nbsp;feel&nbsp;for&nbsp;what&nbsp;it's&nbsp;like to&nbsp;build&nbsp;AI solutions at Volta&nbsp;Medical.&nbsp;


