About the Role

Are you passionate about language, technology, and data quality? Join our global community of AI specialists and contribute to the development of next-generation Generative AI systems used by millions of people worldwide.
We are looking for detail-oriented professionals with experience in annotation, content review, quality assurance, or data operations to support multilingual and multimodal AI projects.


Project Details


Job Title: Generative AI Analyst - Dutch (Netherlands)
Location: Remote, Netherlands
Commitment: 4&nbsp;weeks
Employment Type: Freelance Contract&nbsp;
Pay Rate: $28/hour


What You’ll Do
Review, evaluate, and annotate AI-generated content across text, images, audio, and video
Perform quality checks to ensure accuracy, consistency, and compliance with project guidelines
Identify edge cases, inconsistencies, and opportunities for improvement
Contribute to the development of high-quality datasets used to train advanced AI models
