Native-level proficiency in Dutch (Netherlands)
Strong written communication skills in English
Excellent attention to detail and analytical thinking
Experience in annotation, content review, quality assurance, data labeling, localization, or related fields
Ability to work independently and follow detailed guidelines
Experience working with multilingual, multimedia, or AI-related content is highly preferred
