&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You take ownership of quality assurance across complex system landscapes and continuously develop the testing strategy together with the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You design, implement, and maintain automated tests using &lt;strong&gt;Java&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring a high and sustainable level of test automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You analyze requirements and system architectures, derive suitable test scenarios, and ensure quality across different system components and interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You test how different systems and technologies work together, particularly in the context of &lt;strong&gt;databases and Kafka&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You ensure test readiness—from test data and environments to the right tools and frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You integrate automated tests into &lt;strong&gt;CI/CD pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;, advance continuous testing, and support releases through to go-live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You identify quality risks early, propose solutions independently, and help advance our QA and test automation approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;]&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;} ;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;{ following_qualifications_would_be_in_line_with_our_desired_profile_for_this_position: [&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have several years of solid professional experience in software quality assurance and can take ownership independently from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test automation is one of your core strengths, and you have extensive experience designing and implementing automated tests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have very strong Java skills and are confident using common test automation tools and frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong understanding of software and system architectures and can quickly grasp relationships, dependencies, and quality risks in complex system landscapes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have solid knowledge of databases and experience with Kafka and event-driven architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;independently, in an organized and solution-oriented way, quickly get up to speed on new topics, and proactively move them forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You communicate confidently with different stakeholders and have very good spoken and written German and English. An ISTQB certification is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident communication in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;German and English&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally &lt;strong&gt;B2 level and above&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
