&lt;h1&gt;Growth at Private Equity Insights&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you excited about solving real, hard problems? Are you looking to work in an exceptional entrepreneurial team with ambitious, motivated and extremely driven people? And do you want real ownership from your first week? If so, now is the time to apply for the Growth role at Private Equity Insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The mission: build the world&#39;s largest network for private equity investors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work in sprints and get fast execution under your skin. You will learn to write copy that makes elite investors act, map the entire market of investors, decide who to target, and deploy AI to outperform a teams of 20+ people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want an ambitious mission, real ownership and the fastest learning curve of your career, apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why Private Equity Insights&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Private Equity Insights is the world’s largest Private Equity community with 1m PE professionals, delivering impact through 12 global PE conferences with thousands of the world’s best investors and operators such as Blackstone, BlackRock, Apollo, Carlyle, CVC, KKR, and many more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Private Equity Insights is part of United Media (https://www.united-media.com/) which focuses on building large-scale industry media and conferences products in sectors such as insurance, finance, retail, etc. As of today, we have organically launched 5 media companies and exited 1.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we offer you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership from the very start.&lt;/strong&gt; You own outcomes, not tasks. We agree the goal, and you find the way&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unlimited growth potential.&lt;/strong&gt; We strongly believe in and have a track record of promoting internally. You can expect coaching and development from leaders, peers and experts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills that compound for life.&lt;/strong&gt; Fast execution, copywriting, pricing, conversion optimisation, structured problem solving, and the ability to create impact anywhere in the business at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master the highest bar in the world.&lt;/strong&gt; Our audience is the world&#39;s most demanding investors. They ignore anything average. If your work can make them act, you can make anyone act.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel opportunity.&lt;/strong&gt; You will be joining our conferences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will vary; however, some of them will be to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the audience.&lt;/strong&gt; Identify, target, and convert every fund into our community, and make sure each one receives the right message, at the right time, and never one too many.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own marketing channels that drive revenue. &lt;/strong&gt;Through existing and new marketing channels, you execute activities that ultimately will drive revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Write copy that persuades.&lt;/strong&gt; Every email, landing page and post. Become the best copywriter and leverage it at scale with AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sprint, test, implement.&lt;/strong&gt; Measure the impact of all experiments you run, test offers, copy, prices and pages until the numbers move.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build systems, not one-offs.&lt;/strong&gt; Anything you do twice becomes a playbook or an AI workflow, so the next win takes less effort than the last.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do whatever it takes to win.&lt;/strong&gt; Some days that means designing an AI workflow. Some days it means checking investors in at the registration desk at 7am. Nobody here is too good for the work that deliver value to the client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we expect from you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;You possess an unparalleled work ethic with a high sense of urgency. You have a relentless drive and desire to be the very best at what you do. You take ownership of everything you do, are proactive and follow through on commitments. Moreover, you’re humble and you share our passion for building and executing new businesses. Furthermore, we expect that you:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 to 3 years of experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Min. a bachelor or master degree with great results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A UK work permit. We do not sponsor visas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong work ethic with a sense of urgency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional drive and desire to be the best at what you do&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive approach and sense of ownership/responsibility of everything you do&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A humble approach and share our passion for building companies and developing people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interested in continuous learning and proactively searching for ways to optimise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
