&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are PMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PMG, a global independent platform company engineered for impact, integrates business strategy, media, creative, and data within a single operating model powered by our proprietary operating system, Alli. With more than 1,000 employees, PMG partners with brands including Apple, Nike, Dropbox, Experian, Sephora, and Whole Foods. Our work has earned top industry honors, including Cannes Lions and Adweek’s Media Plan of the Year, and PMG has won 40+ workplace culture awards, including being the only company to rank among Ad Age’s Best Places to Work for 11 consecutive years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kickstart your career with PMG’s Graduate Leadership Programme!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you gearing up to graduate with a bachelor’s or master’s degree and ready to dive into the world of digital marketing? PMG’s Graduate Leadership Programme Media Marketing track offers a full-time role where you&#39;ll drive tangible results for brands like Nike, Therabody, and Peloton right from the start. Located in the bustling heart of London, you’ll develop industry expertise and build a strong network.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programme Highlights:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Immersive Training: &lt;/strong&gt;Jump into an intensive onboarding programme designed to catapult you into the media and marketing industries. Think of this as your career launchpad.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-On Learning: &lt;/strong&gt;Get ready to take on projects that matter and gain client exposure early in your career. You’ll learn the ropes of digital marketing, campaign strategy, and tech-driven solutions - building the knowledge and confidence to step up as a leader.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Channel Media Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Dive into strategies across search, social, display, and video. You’ll manage budgets, craft campaigns, and analyse data to maximise impact—building the well-rounded expertise across channels to catapult your career in media marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Enabled, Human-Led Ways of Working: &lt;/strong&gt;See how AI and automation are reshaping the work of modern marketers. You’ll use technology to accelerate research, strengthen quality checks, streamline repeatable tasks, and uncover insights more efficiently. Just as importantly, you’ll learn to evaluate AI-generated outputs and apply human judgment before making recommendations or taking action. At PMG, technology should extend your thinking - not replace it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Academic Prowess: &lt;/strong&gt;Completed a Bachelor’s or Master’s Degree between July 2026 and June 2027 in Business, Marketing, Advertising, Communication, or a related field.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Savvy: &lt;/strong&gt;Proficient in Microsoft Excel and comfortable using AI tools to analyse data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Prior internships or work experience relevant to the marketing &amp;amp; advertising industry can help your resume stand out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Authorisation to Work: &lt;/strong&gt;Please note, we do not offer visa sponsorship for this role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why PMG?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive Salary &amp;amp; Bonuses: &lt;/strong&gt;We reward your hard work and passion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Top-Notch Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Including but not limited to private healthcare, employer pension contribution and £150 per month commuter allowance, and even recognition points which convert to vouchers to spend at retailers such as John Lewis, TicketMaster and Eurostar - we’ve got you covered in all aspects of life.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Award-Winning Culture: &lt;/strong&gt;Work at the only company Ad Age named a Best Place to Work eleven years in a row. Enjoy perks like plentiful snacks, in office lunches every week, and an unmatched culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow With Us: &lt;/strong&gt;With access to industry experts, mentors, and social events, your growth is our priority.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to Apply?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Step into a role where your contributions are recognised and your ideas valued. Embark on your career journey at PMG - more than just a job, it’s a foundation to a strong career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-ONSITE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance-Based Rewards:&lt;/strong&gt; Your impact should be part of your reward. This role is eligible for PMG’s annual bonus program—a standout part of our total compensation offering and an opportunity to share in our success. Bonus awards are informed by individual impact and performance, as well as team and company results, and are subject to applicable program terms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Development: &lt;/strong&gt;Keep growing through learning and development programs, mentorship opportunities, and support for career advancement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generous Time Off: &lt;/strong&gt;Take the time you need to recharge, connect with loved ones, and enjoy life outside work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Parental Leave: &lt;/strong&gt;Receive paid parental leave during life’s important family moments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retirement Benefits: &lt;/strong&gt;Build for your future with competitive retirement benefits, including employer contributions or matching where applicable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fertility and Family Support: &lt;/strong&gt;Access fertility and family-building benefits for eligible employees and their spouses or partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Healthcare: &lt;/strong&gt;Choose from medical, dental, and vision coverage designed to support you and your family.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pet Insurance: &lt;/strong&gt;Access optional coverage for the four-legged members of your family.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lifestyle Spending Account: &lt;/strong&gt;Receive company-funded support for eligible health and well-being expenses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commuter Benefits: &lt;/strong&gt;Access support for your commute where available.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Volunteering Opportunities: &lt;/strong&gt;Receive eight paid hours each year to give back to your community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Tools and Training: &lt;/strong&gt;Access enterprise AI tools and ongoing training that helps PMGers use AI effectively, creatively, and responsibly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our benefits and compensation programs may vary by location and eligibility and are subject to applicable plan terms. We’ll share full details during the hiring process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Sets Us Apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Being part of PMG means joining a company culture that’s unmatched in digital. We&#39;re dedicated to working hard to serve our employees and clients, delivering value, results, and innovation—which often requires true grit and agility. We believe in taking care of ourselves and each other to continuously improve in every way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In alignment with our core values to be inclusive and always change for the better, PMG is committed to creating a more diverse and inclusive culture, and we are proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We believe that we only change for the better by bringing diverse perspectives to our company. PMG recruits, employs, trains, compensates, and promotes regardless of race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hi, we&#39;re TechnologyAdvice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Nashville, Tennessee, TechnologyAdvice helps millions of B2B technology buyers make smarter decisions by providing trusted research, practical guidance, and connections to the world&#39;s leading technology brands. Our work spans 30+ media brands and 50+ newsletters, supported by a global team across the United States, United Kingdom, Singapore, Australia, and the Philippines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a remote-first company that values curiosity, collaboration, and growth. We invest in our people, embrace AI and new technologies to improve how we work, and create opportunities for team members to build meaningful careers. Many of our leaders have grown from within, including our CEO, who started here as an intern.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe great work happens when people feel connected. Through company all-hands, team events, Slack communities, learning sessions, and in-person gatherings, we create intentional opportunities for our global team to collaborate, build relationships, and celebrate successes together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;All positions are open to remote work unless otherwise specified in the requirements below.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Channel Insider, part of TechnologyAdvice, is looking for an experienced Account Director to become the first dedicated EMEA channel sales specialist within our growing EMEA business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a rare opportunity to step into a senior, highly visible, first feet on the ground role with the mandate to help shape, launch, and scale Channel Insider’s EMEA commercial presence. You will join TechnologyAdvice at an exciting stage of growth, with the backing of an established global business, a strong brand portfolio, proven demand generation capabilities, and a leadership team committed to building something meaningful in the EMEA channel market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior, quota-carrying role with ownership of the full sales cycle. You will identify and develop high-value client relationships, engage senior marketing and channel decision-makers, uncover commercial challenges, and position tailored solutions across digital brand, content, events, audience engagement, and demand generation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will be someone who knows the channel ecosystem, understands how vendors and partners go to market, and can bring credibility, confidence, and commercial energy into senior client conversations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While you will be accountable for your own revenue number, you will not be building in isolation. You will have the support of TechnologyAdvice’s senior leadership, client success, delivery, marketing, StudioA, product, sales enablement, SDRs, and the wider global business. This is a role for someone who wants ownership, visibility, pace, and the opportunity to make a genuine mark on a developing market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; United Kingdom&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute a comprehensive account/territory plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow channel accounts both in terms of their finite number and their annual value&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospect effectively, organizing your time, and deliver professional and memorable sales pitches to new prospects and existing contacts to achieve quota.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and execute key sales and business development strategies to increase pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct market research to identify selling possibilities and evaluate customer needs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create personalized, compelling value propositions around TechnologyAdvice’s channel offerings and deliver appropriate proposals that accurately describe those products and set proper expectations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate and close deals, handle objections and challenges, and manage annual contract negotiations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remain current on industry trends, market activities, and competitors.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with client success to ensure best-in-class service that maximizes repeat business and high regard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;1&quot;&gt;An outcomes-oriented channel salesperson with 3+ years of experience selling marketing solutions to or with IT channel marketing and executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Proven track record in winning brand-to-demand, demand generation and digital media campaigns, driving substantial revenue growth through both incumbent and net new accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Unrelenting drive and competitive spirit, consistently thriving in high-pressure environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Ability to successfully craft and implement sophisticated account/territory plans with long-term growth objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Experience with MDF, Co-op, and other vendor reimbursement-funded models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Skilled in diagnosing client needs and designing tailored high-impact business solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Demonstrated success in negotiating complex contracts, ensuring win-win outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Deep expertise in brand-to-demand, demand generation, and digital media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Ambitious, fresh-thinking, confident, and inquisitive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Agile professional who excels in a fast-paced environment and thrives on continuously pivoting strategies to drive business needs forward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Advance with mentorship programs, leadership academies, and opportunities to shape company culture and DEI initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flex Fridays:&lt;/strong&gt; Adjust your 40-hour week to enjoy a full or half day off on Fridays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote-First Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Work from the comfort of your home.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Private Health &amp;amp; Dental Insurance&lt;/strong&gt;: Comprehensive coverage, including discounted gym memberships and additional perks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid Time Off&lt;/strong&gt;: Start with 25 days of holiday per year, with an additional day added for each year of service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/strong&gt;: Supportive maternity and paternity leave policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary Sacrifice Nursery Benefit&lt;/strong&gt;: Save on childcare costs with our tax-efficient program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life Assurance&lt;/strong&gt;: Peace of mind with coverage to protect your loved ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pension Plan:&lt;/strong&gt; Invest in your future with our competitive pension scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Assistance Program&lt;/strong&gt;: Access free counseling and other support services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness Perks:&lt;/strong&gt; Access the Headspace app to support your well-being.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Speaker Series Bonus:&lt;/strong&gt; Present in our monthly speaker series and earn a bonus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work authorization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Employer work visa sponsorship and support are not provided for this role. Applicants must be currently authorized to work in the United Kingdom at hire and must maintain authorization to work in the United Kingdom throughout their employment with our company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary Range&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We seek to hire top-tier individuals and intend for our compensation to be at a rate that allows us to recruit and retain individuals who align with our core values, purpose, mission, and vision.&amp;nbsp;Final total compensation is based on a multitude of factors including, but not limited to, skill level, relevant experience to the position, and cost of labor.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual pay range:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£70,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£90,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Total annual compensation including commission up to:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£100,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£130,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EOE statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We believe that our differences make us stronger, and thus foster a diverse and inclusive culture where people feel safe being themselves. TechnologyAdvice is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, age, religion, sex, national origin, disability, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected under federal, state or local law.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Pre-employment screening required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;TechnologyAdvice does not engage with external staffing agencies. Any candidates introduced by such firms will not be eligible for compensation. TechnologyAdvice communicates only through&amp;nbsp;&lt;code class=&quot;c-mrkdwn__code&quot; ----- and official recruiting platforms. We never recruit via Teams, WhatsApp, or similar apps, and we will never request money, gift cards, or personal financial details during hiring.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Any AI-generated or incomplete application answers will be auto-rejected.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Payoneer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2005, Payoneer is the global financial platform that removes friction from doing business across borders, with a mission to connect the world’s underserved businesses to a rising global economy. We’re a community with over 2,500 colleagues all over the world, working to serve customers, and partners in over 190 countries and territories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By taking the complexity out of the financial workflows–including everything from global payments and compliance to multi-currency and workforce management, to providing working capital and business intelligence–we give businesses the tools they need to work efficiently worldwide and grow with confidence.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: London&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Time&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Strategic Account Director is a new-business, quota-carrying hunter responsible for landing the largest, most complex enterprise logos in the market. You own the full pursuit — from target identification and outbound generation through multi-threaded, committee-driven sales cycles to signed, revenue-producing contracts. Your prospects run cross-border volume at scale, they are today served by incumbent banks or specialist fintechs, and displacing that incumbent is the job.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role for someone who is energized by the chase: building conviction where none exists, getting into the CFO&#39;s and Treasurer&#39;s office cold, orchestrating a pursuit team through a long and technical evaluation, and closing seven-figure relationships. You set the bar for how strategic new business gets won at Payoneer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a strategic role. It is deliberately seated centrally under Global Sales so the strategic-accounts motion can be built, proven, and standardized before ownership is distributed to the regions. You will work hand in hand with regional heads of sales for in-market coordination and, over time, help shape how this function scales across the field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hunt and land net-new strategic accounts. &lt;/strong&gt;Own a new-business quota. Identify, prioritize, and pursue the highest-value target accounts in your territory (typically $500K+/month cross-border volume, up to $10M+/month strategic targets) and convert them into signed, funded customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generate your own pipeline. &lt;/strong&gt;Build top-of-funnel through disciplined, research-led outbound — direct executive outreach, referrals, partner and ecosystem channels, and events. Do not wait for leads; create them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Break into the buying committee cold. &lt;/strong&gt;Get in front of and build conviction with CFOs, Treasurers, Finance Operations, and Compliance/Risk leaders at target accounts. Multi-thread deliberately so a deal never rests on a single contact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Displace the incumbent. &lt;/strong&gt;Position Payoneer&#39;s speed, global coverage, economics, and platform breadth to unseat incumbent banks and specialist competitors. Run competitive displacement plays and build the business case that moves an entrenched buyer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own complex, long-cycle deals end to end. &lt;/strong&gt;Drive multi-stakeholder, technical, compliance-sensitive evaluations from first meeting to close. Own the mutual close plan, procurement, legal, and commercial negotiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sell the platform. &lt;/strong&gt;Lead with value, not features. Land the entry wedge and architect the deal to open cross-border payments plus high-value services (Capital, Treasury/FX, Embedded/Platform Payments, Workforce/EOR, and emerging rails) — maximizing initial contract value and expansion potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualify with discipline. &lt;/strong&gt;Apply Payoneer&#39;s Sandler-based methodology — Up-Front Contracts, Pain Funnel, budget and decision qualification — to every pursuit so you invest team resources only in winnable, real deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate the pursuit team. &lt;/strong&gt;Direct Solutions/Pre-Sales, Product Specialists, Compliance, and RevOps as a coordinated deal team through the sales cycle, and quarterback executive sponsorship where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecast honestly and close on time. &lt;/strong&gt;Own a credible, hygienic pipeline and forecast in CRM. Drive deals to close dates and call your number straight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set up the win for the long term. &lt;/strong&gt;Land with a clean handoff to Customer Success and a clear expansion thesis, so every logo you close becomes a growth account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in enterprise B2B sales with a strong bias toward new business / new logo acquisition — not primarily account management or renewals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent, demonstrable record of hitting or exceeding a new-business quota on complex, high-value deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to self-generate pipeline through outbound and to break into cold enterprise accounts at the executive level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience closing long-cycle, multi-stakeholder deals with meaningful (six- to seven-figure) contract value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success selling into and navigating executive buying committees — CFO, Treasury, Finance, Compliance/Risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial and negotiation skills, including running procurement, legal, and margin-protective deal structuring to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency operating in a matrix environment and orchestrating a cross-functional pursuit team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in payments, fintech, banking, treasury, FX, or cross-border commerce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of competitive displacement against incumbent banks or specialist fintechs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling a multi-product platform and structuring land-and-expand entry deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with a structured sales methodology (Payoneer uses Sandler).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to compliance-sensitive, regulated sales environments (KYC/AML-aware selling).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong CRM discipline and data-driven pipeline management (e.g., Salesforce).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-FD1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Payoneer Ways of Working&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Act as our customer’s partner on the inside&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Learning what they need and creating what will help them go further.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Do it. Own it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Being fearlessly accountable in everything we do.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Continuously improve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Always striving for a higher standard than our last.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Build each other up&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Helping each other grow, as professionals and people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;If this sounds like a business, a community, and a mission you want to be part of, apply today.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to providing a diverse and inclusive workplace. Payoneer is an equal opportunity employer, and all qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment no matter your race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law. If you require reasonable accommodation at any stage of the hiring process, please speak to the recruiter managing the role for any adjustments. Decisions about requests for reasonable accommodation are made on a case-by-case basis.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About THG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are THG, a global ecommerce group on a mission to be the global online leader in beauty and sports nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our portfolio of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; leading retailers and brands such as LOOKFANTASTIC, Myprotein, ESPA, Perricone MD, and Cult Beauty form our two core businesses: THG Beauty and THG Nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;From Manchester to New York, we’re powered by a team of over 2500 people who work together, lead by example, and think BIG.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;With us, you’ll go further, faster. What are you waiting for?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Icon 1, WA15 0AF&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at THG Beauty&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We know that beauty isn’t one-size-fits-all. Our portfolio of leading retailers and iconic beauty brands caters to everyone, everywhere, empowering customers all over the world to look and feel fantastic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By combining our portfolio of owned brands inclusive of ESPA, Ameliorate and Christophe Robin, with a marketplace for over 1,300 third-party beauty brands through online retail sites LOOKFANTASTIC, Cult Beauty, and Dermstore, THG Beauty&#39;s ambition is to be the global digital partner of choice across the beauty industry, supporting the channel shift to online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;THG Beauty’s breadth of relationships is unique to the beauty market; it engages with brands as a retailer, a brand owner, and a product developer and manufacturer, making it the industry’s digital strategic leader.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Why be a Senior Analyst - Customer (Beauty) at THG?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Analyst in the Beauty Customer team, you will own analytical work that helps THG’s Beauty division understand and grow its customer base. Working across acquisition, retention, CRM, marketing and loyalty, you will build the analysis, models and insight that enable the business to make better decisions about how it acquires and retains customers. You are expected to work largely independently — owning complex analytical problems end-to-end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Analyst — Customer (Beauty)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, you will: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own analytical projects across the customer lifecycle — acquisition, retention, CRM, loyalty, marketing performance and personalisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build customer segmentations, cohort analyses and behavioural models that the business can act on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse marketing channel performance — understanding what drives efficient acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support development of the Beauty customer KPI framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to marketing mix modelling (MMM) — providing customer and channel inputs, and connecting MMM outputs back to customer-level acquisition and retention decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Synthesise quantitative data with qualitative insight (customer research, surveys, feedback) to build a rounded view of customer behaviour&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and maintain SQL queries and analytical scripts — producing accurate, well-documented analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Engineering team to understand the customer data model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build dashboards and reports that communicate customer performance clearly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
