&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Rimes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rimes provides the Intelligence Fabric for Capital Markets, a trusted data network and intelligence architecture that transforms fragmented data, operations and workflows into decision-grade intelligence. The world’s leading institutional investors, asset managers, and service providers rely on Rimes to help them make better investment decisions that power more than US$ 75 trillion in AUM annually.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;A Senior Solution Consultant at Rimes is a recognized functional expert who leads workstreams and initiatives across client engagements. You have firm, working knowledge of your domain both from a business and technical perspective and you use that expertise to own outcomes, not just tasks.&amp;nbsp;You are self-managing: you set your own priorities within agreed project objectives, manage your stakeholders without prompting, and lead the consultants working alongside you. You bring a strategic lens to your engagements, identifying what is not being asked as well as what is and you are trusted to represent Rimes&#39; capabilities in complex client environments independently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rimes Professional Services is the change agent that enables clients to unlock value from Rimes&#39; data management, benchmarking, and platform services. The Solution Consulting team sits at the heart of PS spanning the full client engagement lifecycle from initial scoping and requirements discovery through to solution design, delivery, validation, and adoption&amp;nbsp;The Consulting function operates across three primary product tracks self-serviced Data Management and Investment Intelligence, Rimes-serviced Data Management, and Benchmarks &amp;amp; Indices (B&amp;amp;I) each with its own delivery model, which is reflected throughout this job description.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WILL YOU DO:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Engagement &amp;amp; Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead requirements discovery across complex, multi-workstream engagements, including facilitated workshops with senior client stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interpret ambiguous or conflicting requirements, identifying the underlying need and guiding clients towards solutions that address it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage scope proactively — identifying scope creep, influencing clients towards pragmatic approaches, and ensuring changes are managed formally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary Rimes consulting point of contact for your assigned client workstreams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Design &amp;amp; Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and own solution approaches for complex client use cases, covering multiple asset classes and data domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead solution design sessions and client workshops, facilitating effective engagement and clear decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify opportunities to improve client processes and expand the value Rimes delivers beyond the immediate project scope&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge non-standard client approaches confidently and constructively, backed by evidence and comparable engagement experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and quality-assure solution designs and documentation produced by Solution Consultants on your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery &amp;amp; Team Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own delivery outcomes across your assigned workstreams, taking accountability for the quality and timeliness of your team&#39;s contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate and actively manage delivery risks; escalate promptly when senior involvement is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and guide Solution Consultants working alongside you — reviewing outputs, providing constructive feedback, and helping them develop their capability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally across Professional Services, Product and Engineering teams as needed to drive delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Validation, Adoption &amp;amp; Practice Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead UAT planning and execution, defining acceptance criteria and managing client engagement through the testing cycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide clients through technology change, identifying adoption risks and addressing them proactively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development and improvement of PS best practices, delivery standards, and methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide structured feedback to Product teams on client needs, product gaps, and field observations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;General Delivery and Change&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support change beyond formal project delivery where required, including smaller client change, post-deployment enhancements, defects and transition activity, applying your expertise to understand the need, shape the appropriate solution and support it through to a successful outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support wider Professional Services and Rimes priorities as required, including internal projects, change initiatives and activities aligned to company and functional OKRs, contributing your expertise wherever it can add value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead adoption of AI-enabled workflows within your engagements, identifying where new tooling can accelerate delivery or improve quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to team capability-building by sharing effective AI workflow practices with less experienced colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay actively current with evolving AI capabilities relevant to your product track&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Desired Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep working knowledge of investment management, asset management, or financial data operations across multiple domains (e.g. equities, fixed income, alternatives, derivatives)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of data management workflows and technical considerations relevant to the product track&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience leading client-facing solutioning and delivery on complex, multi-workstream engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring or guiding more junior practitioners in a consulting or delivery environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Rimes products or deep experience with comparable data management or benchmarking platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead complex solution design and translate it into actionable, well-communicated delivery plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management — able to influence at project and operational level without formal authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication across operational, project, and senior client audiences — able to calibrate message to audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable managing competing priorities across multiple workstreams independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Constructive challenge — advocating for best practices diplomatically while maintaining client relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Attributes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountable for outcomes, not just tasks and takes ownership of what the team delivers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-managing: sets priorities, manages stakeholders, and escalates proactively without being prompted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural informal leader and mentor and invests time in developing the consultants around them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brings a strategic perspective and sees what is not being asked as well as what is&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently models the professional standards in the PS Consulting Excellence Framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Only selected candidates will be contacted for interviews. We appreciate your understanding. Thank you for considering a career with us.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rimes is committed to promote the values of diversity and inclusion throughout the business. Whether it’s through recruitment, retention, career progression or training and development, we are committed to improving opportunities for people regardless of their background or circumstances.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rimes.com/careers&quot;&gt;Careers&lt;/a&gt; page to see our complete listings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Strength in Trust&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;OneTrust’s mission is to enable innovation through the responsible use of data and AI. We believe that ensuring data is trusted shouldn’t slow teams down—it should accelerate what’s possible. This led us to develop the first technology platform for responsible data use in 2016. Today, with AI representing the latest and most impactful expansion of data yet, OneTrust is once again redefining what responsible innovation looks like. OneTrust, the AI‑Ready Governance Platform™, unifies regulatory intelligence, automation, and connected governance workflows so businesses can continue to move at the speed of AI while ensuring good governance to prevent data misuse at scale. Trusted by thousands of organizations worldwide, OneTrust is shaping the future where trusted data becomes a transformative force for business and society.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Challenge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Technical Architect (Privacy) to join our Technical Advisory team (part of Customer Success). This is a customer-facing role for someone who combines a strong technical foundation with attention to details, and the ability to build trust with customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work with privacy, legal, compliance, and technology stakeholders to understand business objectives and challenges, assess maturity and platform adoption, and provide clear recommendations across privacy processes, operating models, workflows, data, and integrations. You will act as a trusted advisor and product expert without owning hands-on implementation or configuration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Previous privacy or OneTrust expertise is valuable, but it is not the defining requirement for this role. We are looking for someone with the attitude, consultancy skills, and technical capability to learn the privacy domain quickly and become a trusted advisor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead outcome-focused discovery, advisory engagements, workshops, and expert sessions with customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clarify customer objectives, constraints, stakeholders, and desired outcomes before recommending a path forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business and regulatory needs into practical recommendations for privacy processes, workflows, data, integrations, and OneTrust capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explain solution options, dependencies, trade-offs, and implications for scale at the appropriate level of detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess customer readiness, adoption barriers, process maturity, and solution direction; recommend pragmatic next steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create clear, decision-ready deliverables such as current-state assessments, future-state recommendations, reference architectures, process guidance, and reusable patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships and communicate confidently with both technical and executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Customer Success, Product, Sales, Support, Professional Services, and other specialist teams to deliver consistent customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture recurring customer needs and translate them into feedback, enablement content, playbooks, and product opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear advisory boundaries: provide strategic framing, product expertise, and guidance while enabling customers or delivery partners to execute implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Experience Includes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in consulting, technical advisory, solution consulting, customer success, business analysis, transformation, or another customer-facing problem-solving role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong technical background in enterprise software (ideally SaaS), systems, data, workflow design, integrations, APIs, solution architecture, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A consultative approach: you listen carefully, ask effective questions, structure ambiguity, and turn complex problems into clear recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong learning agility and a constructive attitude, including curiosity, ownership, humility, resilience, and openness to feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to connect customer objectives to practical technology and operating-model decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to adapt the message for executive, functional, and technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independent but also a team player&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience influencing stakeholders and collaborating across functions without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BA/BS in a related subject is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extra Impressive:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in privacy, data protection, privacy operations, privacy technology, or a closely related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with OneTrust Privacy Automation or comparable privacy-management platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with privacy regulations and frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;OneTrust certifications or relevant privacy credentials such as CIPP/E, CIPM, CIPT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience advising enterprise customers on adoption, optimization, governance, or value realization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating reusable advisory playbooks, reference architectures, or enablement materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in using software for reporting and task management, such as Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;Where we Work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are embracing an office-first culture, encouraging three days a week in office for most roles, with meaningful opportunities to collaborate and celebrate in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each role may have specific requirements or flexibility depending on the scope of the position, so we encourage you to verify this with your recruiter during your first interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;As an employee at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;OneTrust&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;, you will be part of the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;OneTeam&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;. That means &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;you’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt; receive support physically, mentally, and emotionally so that you can do your best work both in and out of the office. This includes comprehensive healthcare coverage, flexible PTO, equity RSUs, annual performance bonus opportunities, retirement account support, 14+ weeks of paid parental leave, career development opportunities, company-paid privacy certification exam fees, and much more. Specific benefits differ by country. For more information, talk to your recruiter or visit onetrust.com/careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Resources&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check out the following to learn more about OneTrust and its people:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
