&lt;section class=&quot;styles--3vx-H&quot; data-ui=&quot;job-description&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MinIO is the data and memory foundation for enterprise AI. Built for the speed, scale, and economics that AI and analytics demand, AIStor and MemKV unify every layer of the data stack, from agentic and inference context memory to tables and objects across core, edge, and cloud. Trusted by 77% of the Fortune 100, MinIO is redefining how AI factories, intelligent applications, and autonomous agents secure, persist, and unlock the full value of their data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly technical, visionary, and customer-centric Field CTO to act as our premier technical ambassador. In this role, you will bridge the gap between MinIO’s engineering innovation and the strategic business needs of our largest, most complex enterprise customers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a Field CTO, you will engage in peer-to-peer conversations with enterprise C-suites (CIOs, CTOs, CDOs) and lead architectural discussions with principal engineers. A deep, hands-on understanding of modern AI architectures (LLMs, RAG, deep learning pipelines) and modern analytics data systems (Iceberg, Delta Lake, Trino, Spark) is mandatory. You will not only evangelize MinIO’s capabilities but also act as a trusted advisor, helping organizations architect their data infrastructure to support next-generation workloads.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Advisory &amp;amp; Evangelism:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a trusted technical advisor to C-level executives at Fortune 500 companies. Articulate the strategic value of high-performance object storage in the context of AI readiness and data democratization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architectural Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and validate complex, large-scale architectures for enterprise customers. Guide them in integrating MinIO seamlessly into their AI/ML pipelines and modern data lakehouse ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Thought Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Represent MinIO at major industry conferences, webinars, and meetups. Write technical whitepapers, reference architectures, and blog posts focusing on the intersection of object storage, generative AI, and modern analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pre-Sales &amp;amp; Post-Sales Strategic Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with enterprise sales and customer success teams on high-stakes deals. Unblock technical objections and provide strategic guidance during Proof of Concepts (PoCs) and large-scale deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Strategy Feedback Loop: &lt;/strong&gt;Serve as the &quot;voice of the customer&quot; to MinIO’s product and engineering teams. Distill market trends, customer pain points, and emerging AI/Analytics patterns into actionable product requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;styles--3vx-H&quot; data-ui=&quot;job-requirements&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in technical leadership roles (e.g., Enterprise Architect, Chief Architect, VP of Engineering, or previous Field CTO).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in a customer-facing or evangelist capacity, successfully presenting to both highly technical audiences and C-level business executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Machine Learning Architectures:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep architectural understanding of &lt;strong&gt;Generative AI and Large Language Models (LLMs)&lt;/strong&gt;, including Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) workflows and vector databases (e.g., Milvus, Qdrant, Pinecone).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;AI/ML data pipelines&lt;/strong&gt; and frameworks (PyTorch, TensorFlow, Ray, Hugging Face).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of hardware bottlenecks in AI, specifically the challenge of feeding data to GPUs (GPU data starvation) and how high-throughput storage solves this.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern Analytics &amp;amp; Data Systems:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in &lt;strong&gt;Open Table Formats&lt;/strong&gt; (Apache Iceberg, Apache Hudi, Delta Lake) and their integration with object storage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with &lt;strong&gt;modern query engines and compute frameworks&lt;/strong&gt; (Trino, Presto, Apache Spark, Flink, StarRocks).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid grasp of the evolution from traditional data warehouses to modern Data Lakehouse architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure &amp;amp; Cloud-Native Tech:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong command of Kubernetes, containerization, and cloud-native orchestration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the AWS S3 API, RESTful APIs, and distributed systems design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;styles--3vx-H&quot; data-ui=&quot;job-benefits&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Policy (EEO)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;MinIO is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and an affirmative action employer. We review applications for employment without regard to their race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, citizenship, age, veteran status, genetic information, physical or mental disability, medical condition, marital status, or any other basis prohibited by law.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We work with the world&#39;s most valuable brands and have global reach across 100+ markets, with deep local expertise.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our people are the key to our success. We&#39;re committed to fostering a culture of creativity, belonging and continuous learning, attracting and developing the brightest talent, and providing exciting career opportunities that help our people grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://eur02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwpp.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CErica.Durr%40wpp.com%7C9bf4566a65bc46a48ac008de749116ea%7C150b5e663d884dee83f6ed149b727a00%7C0%7C0%7C639076363668176216%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=Q9juosud56XGLThSFZ1NpPZd6FXpJPxV74OeRZWoh%2B4%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;WPP.com.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why we&#39;re hiring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an Engineering Lead to help shape and deliver the future of Atlas, one of WPP&#39;s core enterprise platforms. This is a hands-on leadership role where you&#39;ll combine deep technical expertise with people leadership, guiding a team of engineers to build scalable, secure and high-performing integration solutions across our technology ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be the technical lead for the Azure based integration platform and services, driving engineering excellence, supporting the growth of your team, and helping to evolve the way we build and deliver software. Working closely with Product, Architecture and Engineering leaders, you&#39;ll play a key role in turning business needs into highly resilient, enterprise-grade solutions used across WPP.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and delivery of Azure-based applications and integrations, ensuring solutions are scalable, secure and aligned with architectural standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the technical lead for Azure API Management and integration services across the Atlas platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion engineering best practice, including SDLC, CI/CD, code quality, testing, automation, agentic/AI-assisted coding and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor, coach and develop engineers, fostering a high-performing and collaborative team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product, Architecture and delivery teams to translate requirements into robust technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive technical decision-making, manage risks and ensure successful delivery across multiple initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering on multiple high-profile, concurrent integration projects serving large scale internal and client initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience designing and delivering solutions on Microsoft Azure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise across Azure serverless and integration technologies, including API Management, Logic Apps, Function Apps and Event Grid.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing with Python and/or Node.js.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with containerisation technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with modern front-end frameworks such as Vue.js or React.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with relational and NoSQL databases, including MongoDB.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of microservices architecture and Domain-Driven Design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Git-based development practices and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience implementing CI/CD pipelines using GitHub Actions and YAML&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with AI services and cloud-native AI technologies in Azure or AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical application of SOLID principles and Test-Driven Development (TDD).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re open&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;we are inclusive and collaborative; we encourage the free exchange of ideas; we respect and celebrate diverse views. We are open-minded: to new ideas, new partnerships, new ways of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re optimistic&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; we approach all that we do with confidence: to try the new and to seek the unexpected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re extraordinary:&lt;/strong&gt; We are stronger together: through collaboration we achieve the amazing. We are creative leaders and pioneers of our industry; we provide extraordinary every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;ll give you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate, inspired people&lt;/strong&gt; – we champion a culture of people that do extraordinary work&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale and opportunity&lt;/strong&gt; – we offer the opportunity to create, influence and deliver projects at a scale that is unparalleled in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenging and stimulating work&lt;/strong&gt; – unique work and the opportunity to join a group of creative problem solvers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We work with the world&#39;s most valuable brands and have global reach across 100+ markets, with deep local expertise.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our people are the key to our success. We&#39;re committed to fostering a culture of creativity, belonging and continuous learning, attracting and developing the brightest talent, and providing exciting career opportunities that help our people grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://eur02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwpp.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CErica.Durr%40wpp.com%7C9bf4566a65bc46a48ac008de749116ea%7C150b5e663d884dee83f6ed149b727a00%7C0%7C0%7C639076363668176216%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=Q9juosud56XGLThSFZ1NpPZd6FXpJPxV74OeRZWoh%2B4%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;WPP.com.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why we&#39;re hiring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Data Steward in the WPP’s Enterprise Technology Data team, you will be responsible for the hands-on administration and maintenance of master data across one or more enterprise data domains. Reporting to the Global Programme Director - Data, you will be the first line of stewardship, ensuring that golden records are accurate, source system mappings are maintained, and data governance standards are consistently applied.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will execute matching and mapping activities, triage stewardship exceptions, and support the onboarding of new source systems into the MDM framework. Your work will directly impact the trustworthiness and completeness of master data flowing through WPP’s enterprise platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role involves daily data administration including investigating and resolving match conflicts, maintaining entity mappings and hierarchies, classifying data assets, and supporting the operational processes that keep master data healthy across the enterprise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be part of a Data Steward team led by the Global Programme Director - Data, with the opportunity to develop deep expertise in master data management, data governance, and stewardship at enterprise scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master data stewardship and golden record maintenance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute day-to-day stewardship activities including reviewing, approving, and correcting master data records in line with governance standards set by the Global Programme Director - Data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and curate golden records, ensuring survivorship rules are correctly applied and master entities remain accurate and complete.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate and resolve match conflicts, potential duplicates, and merge exceptions, escalating complex cases to the Global Programme Director - Data with supporting analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process new entity creation requests, validating source data against matching rules before golden record creation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Source system mapping and onboarding support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and maintain mappings between source system entities and golden master records, ensuring traceability and accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the onboarding of new agencies and source systems by executing mapping activities and validating initial data loads against MDM standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain reference data configurations, ensuring code sets and lookup values remain aligned across source systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data governance and classification&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply data classification standards to master data entities as defined by the governance framework, covering sensitivity, confidentiality, and regulatory categorisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and correct AI-generated data classifications, providing feedback to improve automated tagging accuracy over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow and enforce stewardship workflows including exception handling, approval processes, and escalation procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate documentation of entity mappings, transformation rules, hierarchy structures, and stewardship decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-assisted stewardship operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the human-in-the-loop for AI-assisted matching and entity resolution, reviewing model-suggested matches, adjudicating low-confidence merge candidates, and approving or rejecting proposed golden record updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and validate AI-generated mapping recommendations during source system onboarding, ensuring accuracy before mappings are committed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide feedback on AI model outputs to support continuous improvement of match accuracy, classification quality, and enrichment relevance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with AI-driven anomaly detection alerts, investigating flagged records and determining appropriate stewardship actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data quality monitoring and remediation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor data quality dashboards and alerts, investigating exceptions and applying remediation actions in a timely manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute data quality checks across master data entities, documenting findings and tracking resolution through to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and update data quality rules as business requirements and source systems evolve, under the direction of the Data Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational reporting and team support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide first-line support for master data issues raised by downstream consumers and business users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to operational reporting on stewardship volumes, exception trends, match rates, and resolution times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support data migration and reconciliation activities during source system onboarding and platform changes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a data stewardship, data administration, or master data management role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical understanding of MDM concepts including golden records, matching, survivorship, and entity resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with enterprise master data management and data governance solutions (e.g. Informatica MDM, Informatica Data Governance) or equivalent platforms is desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL for data investigation, validation, and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of data governance principles including data classification, ownership, and stewardship workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to work with AI and machine learning tools as part of day-to-day stewardship operations, including reviewing AI-suggested matches, classifications, and enrichments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with ERP or HCM data (Workday, SAP, Dynamics, or similar) is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail with the ability to identify and resolve data discrepancies methodically.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisational skills with the ability to manage multiple concurrent stewardship tasks and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication skills with the ability to document and explain findings clearly to both technical and business audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated with a proactive approach to identifying and resolving data problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enthusiasm for developing expertise in master data management, data governance, and AI-assisted data operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re open&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;We are inclusive and collaborative; we encourage the free exchange of ideas; we respect and celebrate diverse views. We are open-minded: to new ideas, new partnerships, new ways of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re optimistic&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span id=&quot;628d56ad5d8a35dab853e65d9daa237c&quot; class=&quot;editor-module-hl-green-solid&quot;&gt;We believe&lt;/span&gt; in the power of creativity, technology and talent to create brighter futures or our people, our clients and our communities. We approach all that we do with conviction: to try the new and to seek the unexpected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re extraordinary:&lt;/strong&gt; we are stronger together: through collaboration we achieve the amazing. We are creative leaders and pioneers of our industry; we provide extraordinary every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;ll give you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate, inspired people&lt;/strong&gt; – We aim to create a culture in which people can do extraordinary work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale and opportunity&lt;/strong&gt; – We offer the opportunity to create, influence and complete projects at a scale that is unparalleled in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenging and stimulating work&lt;/strong&gt; – Unique work and the opportunity to join a group of creative problem solvers. Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;The role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tavily, part of Nebius, is the web access layer for AI agents. Over two million developers use us, and our customers include Fortune 500 companies running agents in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vertical search is where we combine public sources with premium vertical data and shape the result into a product for a specific use case. This role owns that layer end to end. You decide which industries and use cases we productize. With the data team, you find and evaluate the public and premium data providers behind each one. You shape the product surface that sits on top.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will sit with customers in these industries, learn how they actually work, and turn their needs and pain points into clear specs. You will build with engineering, ship it, and make sure go-to-market knows how to sell it. You own the outcome, not just the handoff: from the first market call through to adoption and revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hard part is choosing. There are more verticals worth building than we can build, and the difference between a good year and a wasted one is knowing which ones to invest in and which to walk away from, even when a large customer is asking for another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your first year, we expect you to know our top use cases better than anyone here, ship a product built for one of them that customers will pay more for, and have a defensible view of what comes next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on senior IC role with real ownership. You will work within a small PM team reporting to the Director of Product, alongside engineering, research, data, and go-to-market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the vertical roadmap. You decide where we invest, what we ship for each, and when a vertical is not worth it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the product surface on top of the data, so a customer gets something built for their job.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find and evaluate the data behind each vertical, across public sources and paid providers, and decide what is worth investing in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sit with customers in these industries until you understand their workflow, then turn that into specs engineering can build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set what a good answer looks like in each use case, working with our evaluation team, who own how we measure it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with customer success to learn what customers ask us for and what makes them leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the search owner on how results should be ranked and shaped for each use case.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;We expect you to have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of product management experience, with a meaningful portion in search, data, or industry-specific AI products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building products for a specific industry or use case, combined with enough technical depth to work directly on the data underneath: where it comes from, how good it is, and what it takes to make it usable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of real customer discovery: you have gone deep on how a particular kind of team works, and shipped something because of what you found.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in API-first or developer-platform businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of LLMs, AI agents, and how search and retrieval systems fit into agentic workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A technical background, through a degree in computer science or engineering or equivalent hands-on experience, with the ability to engage deeply with technical architecture and tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to influence and align cross-functional stakeholders without formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;It will be an added bonus if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domain experience in market intelligence, news, financial research, or another data-heavy industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background at a data provider, enrichment vendor, market intelligence platform, or vertical search company, or experience building vertical data products in-house.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience evaluating and working with external data providers, including judging quality and negotiating what you actually need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership experience in a high-growth technology company, especially post-acquisition or startup-within-a-larger-org environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;The role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tavily, part of Nebius, is the web access layer for AI agents. Over two million developers use us, and our customers include Fortune 500 companies running agents in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We build and run our own index. That means we own the hard problems directly: crawl coverage at scale, freshness, cost per query, and the quality of what comes back. This role owns that infrastructure as a product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When an agent asks a question, the answer has to be relevant, fresh, fast, and affordable. Those four things pull against each other, and someone has to decide which one gives. That is you. You will set what good means for each use case we serve and the bar a change has to clear before it ships, working closely with our evaluation team, who own how we measure it. You will also shape where our index goes next: what it needs to cover, how fresh it needs to be, and what it has to be good at.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The most open part of the job is what comes next. Search is being rebuilt for a consumer that is not a person. Agents do not want one result page, they want to break a problem apart, run many retrievals, and decide what to do next. That changes what search infrastructure should look like, and part of your job is to have a view on where ours should go.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hard part is deciding what good enough means. Perfect coverage, perfect freshness, and low cost cannot all be true at once, and the person in this seat is the one who has to make that call for each use case and defend it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your first year, we expect you to set a clear quality bar for our search products that the team builds against, have a real influence on where our index goes next, and bring us a point of view on where search infrastructure is heading.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on senior IC role with real ownership, reporting to the Director of Product. You will work day to day with our search engineering and research teams, with the evaluation team, and with customer success, who bring us quality feedback from real accounts every week. Our search engineers are deeply experienced in large-scale retrieval, and the product team is small, so you will argue your case directly with the people building it. That only works if you have built at this scale yourself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the quality bar and release criteria for search: what good means per use case, and what a change has to clear before it ships. Our evaluation team owns the measurement, and you work closely with them on what to measure and why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the depth, latency, and cost tradeoffs across our search products, and make them explicit and defensible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the direction of our index: what it needs to cover, how fresh it needs to be, and what quality bar it has to meet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a point of view on where search infrastructure is going as agents, rather than people, become the main consumer, and turn that into a roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know how we compare to the alternatives customers evaluate, and drive the work that closes the gaps that matter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with customer success and directly with customers to understand where our results fall short in real workflows, and turn that into quality priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the data and vertical product owners on what our corpus needs to contain and how results should be shaped per industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;We expect you to have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of product management experience, with a meaningful portion spent on high-scale search or ranking systems: web search, feed ranking at a large social platform, or a large ad engine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background as an engineer, ML engineer, or researcher on a production system in one of those areas. This is a requirement rather than a preference. You will be making tradeoff calls alongside senior search engineers, and you need to have built something at that scale yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience shipping a search or ranking change end to end, including how it was evaluated and what happened after it shipped.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong data foundation: you can design an experiment, read eval results critically, and tell a real quality improvement from noise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product judgment to match the technical depth: you can decide what to build and what to leave, and defend it to both engineers and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of LLMs, AI agents, and how retrieval fits into agentic workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity, moving between strategy and execution without losing the thread.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to influence and align cross-functional stakeholders without formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;It will be an added bonus if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Depth in information retrieval, NLP, or applied machine learning beyond what the role requires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with index tiering, sharding, freshness pipelines, or cost-per-query optimisation at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with hybrid retrieval, semantic and lexical search, re-ranking, or human evaluation programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in API-first or developer-platform businesses running both self-serve and enterprise motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a high-growth technology company, especially post-acquisition or startup-within-a-larger-org environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Director of EMEA Field Enablement, you hold a high-impact role at the intersection of strategy and field execution. Rubrik is growing quickly, and the field needs a leader who can connect global corporate strategy with the realities of selling across EMEA’s different markets, buying cultures and levels of maturity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the readiness and productivity of the EMEA sales organization. You’ll architect and scale enablement programs, from onboarding for new hires through to advanced value selling for tenured sellers. The goal is that every Account Executive can clearly communicate Rubrik’s Zero Trust Data Security and AI-driven resilience story to the organizations, from hospitals to governments to financial institutions, that rely on us to keep operating.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work directly with the GVP of EMEA and regional sales leaders, with the backing of Global Enablement and the autonomy to decide what your theater needs. What you build will show up in ramp time, win rates and quota attainment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strategy &amp;amp; Executive Partnership&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the primary strategic partner to the GVP of EMEA, AVPs/RVPs and Regional Directors, tying enablement priorities and KPIs directly to regional revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regional Strategy &amp;amp; Roadmap:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and own the EMEA enablement roadmap, aligned to Global Enablement programs and shaped by leadership input and needs analysis, so investment goes where the biggest gaps are.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Localized Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate global initiatives into regional results by adapting content, examples and delivery to local market conditions and business cultures across EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gap Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Run regular assessments of the sales team’s skills and performance to identify readiness gaps early, and close them before they show up in the forecast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Program Development &amp;amp; Delivery&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Development &amp;amp; Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and deliver enablement in region for both ramping and ramped sellers, from foundational onboarding to advanced value selling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Onboarding:&lt;/strong&gt; Reinforce and extend the global onboarding journey in EMEA, track ramp progress and validate capstones, so new hires reach productivity faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Methodology Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive adoption of Rubrik’s sales methodology (MEDDPICC, Command of the Message) so pipeline qualification and deal execution are consistent across every region and segment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coaching Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Equip front-line sales leaders to reinforce learning through coaching, using AI-assisted coaching tools where they add value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Metrics &amp;amp; Operational Excellence&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Insights:&lt;/strong&gt; Track, analyze and report on the impact of enablement programs using CRM (Salesforce) and sales engagement tools (Clari).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPI Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Measure success through quota attainment, win rates and the adoption of new product plays, and report on them candidly to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 10+ years in Sales Enablement, a Sales role and/or Sales Leadership within a high-growth SaaS or cybersecurity environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; 5 years leading sales teams, with a proven ability to lead through influence rather than authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Design:&lt;/strong&gt; A track record of building and scaling enablement programs, from onboarding through advanced selling, that measurably improved sales performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Methodology:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience driving adoption of a structured sales methodology such as MEDDPICC or Command of the Message.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; A deep understanding of the EMEA sales landscape, regional business practices and the competitive cybersecurity market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Stack:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency with Salesforce and AI-forward CMS/LMS platforms. Experience with AI-assisted coaching tools is a significant advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Architect:&lt;/strong&gt; You don’t just deliver training; you build the systems and frameworks that drive predictable revenue and long-term growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional Communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; You have strong executive presence and can act as the trusted “voice of truth” when presenting to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptable &amp;amp; Resilient:&lt;/strong&gt; You thrive where the product landscape evolves monthly, and you treat continuous learning as part of the job.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-[Remote / Hybrid / Onsite]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (NYSE: RBRK) is the Security and AI Operations Company, delivering one platform built at the intersection of data, identity, and AI. The platform enables agentic cyber resilience and trusted AI operations for enterprises worldwide, built to recover before disruption strikes and stay a step ahead, so security is never the reason ambition stalls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/rubrik-inc/mycompany/verification/&quot;&gt;Linkedin&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/rubrikinc&quot;&gt;X (formerly Twitter)&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/rubrikinc/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rubrik.com&quot;&gt;Rubrik.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Inclusion @ Rubrik&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Rubrik, we are dedicated to fostering a culture where people from all backgrounds are valued, feel they belong, and believe they can succeed. Our commitment to inclusion is at the heart of our mission to secure the world’s data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to hire and promote the best talent, regardless of background. We continually review our hiring practices to ensure fairness and strive to create an environment where every employee has equal access to opportunities for growth and excellence. We believe in empowering everyone to bring their authentic selves to work and achieve their fullest potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our inclusion strategy focuses on three core areas of our business and culture:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Company: We are committed to building a merit-based organization that offers equal access to growth and success for all employees globally. Your potential is limitless here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Culture: We strive to create an inclusive atmosphere where individuals from all backgrounds feel a strong sense of belonging, can thrive, and do their best work. Your contributions help us innovate and break boundaries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Communities: We are dedicated to expanding our engagement with the communities we operate in, creating opportunities for underrepresented talent and driving greater innovation for our clients. Your impact extends beyond Rubrik, contributing to safer and stronger communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer/Veterans/Disabled&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability, genetic information, protected veteran status, or any other status protected by applicable law. Rubrik provides equal employment opportunities to employees and applicants in all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, promotion, compensation, training, leave, and termination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik provides reasonable accommodations to qualified applicants and employees with disabilities in accordance with applicable law. If you need an accommodation to participate in the application process or to perform your job, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- ----- Accommodations may include changes to the application process, documents in an alternate format, a sign language interpreter, or specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO IS THE LAW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/olms/regs/compliance/eo_posters/employeerightsposter2page_19final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;NOTIFICATION OF EMPLOYEE RIGHTS UNDER FEDERAL LABOR LAWS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;🚀 We’re on a mission to make money work for everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re waving goodbye to the complicated and confusing ways of traditional banking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After starting as a prepaid card, our product offering has grown a lot in the last 10 years in the UK. As well as&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/personal&quot;&gt;personal&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/business-banking&quot;&gt;business&lt;/a&gt; bank accounts, we offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/joint-account&quot;&gt;joint accounts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/16-17&quot;&gt;accounts for 16-17 year olds&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/under-16s&quot;&gt;free kids account&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/flex&quot;&gt;credit cards&lt;/a&gt; in the UK, with more exciting things to come beyond. Our UK customers can also &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/savings&quot;&gt;save&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/investments&quot;&gt;invest &lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/pensions&quot;&gt;combine their pensions&lt;/a&gt; with us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our hot coral cards and get-paid-early feature, combined with financial education on social media and our award winning customer service, we have a long history of creating magical moments for our customers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not about selling products - we want to solve problems and change lives through Monzo ❤️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;📍London/Cardiff/UK Remote | 💰£108,700 - £140,000 + equity + Incentive Awards tied to your performance + &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; ✨&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Crime &amp;amp; Fraud Collective&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; ⭐&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re all about building trust and keeping our community safe while helping Monzo grow. The Financial Crime &amp;amp; Fraud Collective is at the heart of this work. As a Senior Fraud Risk Manager, you’ll lead the charge in keeping fraudsters at bay so our customers can bank with total confidence!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get to work across current accounts, business banking, international accounts, and more. While you’ll be managing people and programs, you should also be excited to roll up your sleeves and get hands-on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We need a crack team of crime fighters to help us stay one step ahead as we continue to grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔑 You’ll play a key role by...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Helping to lead our fast-growing global Fraud &amp;amp; Disputes Risk team and work alongside leaders across our cross-functional Fraud Squads. We’re looking for a proactive, collaborative leader who really knows fraud risk management inside and out - spanning several of our authorised fraud, unauthorised fraud, first-party fraud, and disputes specialisms&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll build great relationships with our Product, Engineering, Data, and Operations teams to design smooth, effective fraud controls, investigation processes, and reporting. You’ll also champion a positive team culture and make sure key fraud initiatives stay on track.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your Core Focus Areas include&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraud Strategy &amp;amp; Operational Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Join squad leadership to turn our big-picture fraud vision into practical roadmaps for our UK and EU Banks. You’ll strike the perfect balance between smart protection controls and a seamless customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Control Framework &amp;amp; Fraud SME:&lt;/strong&gt; Be our go-to expert on fraud typologies and prevention tools, overseeing end-to-end design and rollout of strong controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Threat Intelligence &amp;amp; Performance Analytics:&lt;/strong&gt; Embed data and threat monitoring to catch new fraud trends early, turning insights into quick control improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Coordination:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with Product, Engineering, and Ops to keep initiatives aligned and moving forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Leadership &amp;amp; Capability Building&lt;/strong&gt;: Coach, mentor, and grow a fantastic fraud risk team while supporting everyone’s personal and professional development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩 We’d love to hear from you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong experience leading fraud strategy and risk teams, ideally in a fast-moving, regulated environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know UK &amp;amp; EU fraud regulations inside out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re skilled at building tech-driven fraud strategies that scale across operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a proven track record of delivering end-to-end projects and large-scale change programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You stay plugged into industry trends and can quickly respond to new fraud risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You excel at balancing fraud risk with business goals and collaborating to ship new products safely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a supportive coach who loves developing high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re an empathetic communicator who aligns messaging with our core values.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re data-driven, comfortable self-serving data, and love using tech to solve problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hold a relevant industry qualification (such as ICA, Cifas, ACAMS, or CFE).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🙌 What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 £108,700 - £140,000 ➕Incentive Awards tied to your performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍This role can be based in our London office, but we&#39;re open to distributed working within the UK (with ad hoc meetings in London)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰ We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, and at times that suit you and your team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 £1,000 learning budget each year to use on books, training courses and conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏡 We will set you up to work from home; all employees are given Macbooks and for fully remote workers we will provide extra support for your work-from-home setup.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➕ Plus lots more! &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Read our full list of benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌈&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; The application journey has 3 key steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 min call with the recruiter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 min hiring manager call&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 hours of technical and leadership principle interviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;This process should take around 4-5 weeks - your schedule is really important to us, so we promise to be as flexible as possible!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have some guidelines on using Artificial Intelligence (AI) to ace an application and interview at Monzo. &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/the-ultimate-guide-on-using-ai-to-ace-an-interview-at-monzo&quot;&gt;You can read them here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ll only close this role once we have enough applications for the next stage. Please submit your application as soon as possible to make sure you don’t miss out.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-OS1 #LI-REMOTE&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunities for everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity and inclusion are a priority for us and we’re making sure we have lots of support for all of our people to grow at Monzo. At Monzo, we’re embracing diversity by fostering an inclusive environment for all people to do the best work of their lives with us. This is integral to our mission of making money work for everyone. You can read more in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/diversity-and-inclusion&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, 2026 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/our-2026-diversity-and-inclusion-report&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion Report&lt;/a&gt; and 2025 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/gender-pay-gap-report-2025&quot;&gt;Gender Pay Gap Report.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to age, ethnicity, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, or veteran, neurodiversity or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a preferred name, please use it to apply. We don&#39;t need full or birth names at application stage 😊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;🚀 We’re on a mission to make money work for everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re waving goodbye to the complicated and confusing ways of traditional banking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After starting as a prepaid card, our product offering has grown a lot in the last 10 years in the UK. As well as&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/personal&quot;&gt;personal&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/business-banking&quot;&gt;business&lt;/a&gt; bank accounts, we offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/joint-account&quot;&gt;joint accounts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/16-17&quot;&gt;accounts for 16-17 year olds&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/under-16s&quot;&gt;free kids account&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/flex&quot;&gt;credit cards&lt;/a&gt; in the UK, with more exciting things to come beyond. Our UK customers can also &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/savings&quot;&gt;save&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/investments&quot;&gt;invest &lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/pensions&quot;&gt;combine their pensions&lt;/a&gt; with us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our hot coral cards and get-paid-early feature, combined with financial education on social media and our award winning customer service, we have a long history of creating magical moments for our customers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not about selling products - we want to solve problems and change lives through Monzo ❤️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;📍London or Remote (UK) or Barcelona, Spain (Hybrid)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering at Monzo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monzo has successfully launched in Ireland and is expanding across Europe. We&#39;re now entering the next phase of our journey: building and scaling a multi-market European bank.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The EU Engineering organisation sits at the centre of that ambition. We are responsible for helping Monzo launch, grow and operate across Europe, navigating everything from product-market fit and customer growth to regulatory requirements, localisation and operational scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unlike most engineering organisations at Monzo, EU does not own a single product area. We work horizontally across the company, partnering with teams across Payments, Core Banking, Growth, Wealth, Customer Operations, Fincrime, Platform and many others to bring Monzo&#39;s products to new markets and deliver great customer experiences locally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Engineering Director, you&#39;ll lead a distributed engineering organisation across the UK, Spain and remote locations. You&#39;ll partner closely with Product, Design, Data, Operations, Risk, Compliance and executive stakeholders to solve complex problems that span organisational boundaries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role comes through influence, relationships and organisational leadership as much as execution. You&#39;ll need to build alignment across a wide range of teams, create clarity in ambiguity, and help Monzo discover what works in new markets while establishing the foundations that allow us to scale across Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is one of Monzo&#39;s most strategically important areas and a unique opportunity to help build a European bank from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll work on&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a distributed engineering organisation spanning multiple squads, markets and countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and develop Engineering Managers, Senior Engineering Managers and senior technical leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Design, Data, Research, Operations, Risk and Compliance leaders to define and execute Monzo&#39;s European strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive alignment and execution across numerous collectives to ensure Europe receives the capabilities it needs to succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape how Monzo approaches market expansion, localisation, regulatory requirements and multi-market product development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence priorities and outcomes across teams that do not directly report to you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create clarity and momentum in highly ambiguous problem spaces where ownership and solutions are not always obvious.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and evolve organisational structures, operating models and planning processes that allow Monzo to scale effectively across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help identify and validate product-market fit in new markets while balancing short-term delivery and long-term strategic investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with executive leadership to shape the future of Monzo&#39;s European business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You should apply if&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience leading large engineering organisations through other leaders, including Engineering Managers, Senior Engineering Managers and senior individual contributors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have successfully operated in highly complex organisations where outcomes depend on collaboration across many teams and functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are exceptional at building relationships and influencing without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can navigate ambiguity and create clarity where goals, ownership or priorities are not yet fully defined.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience scaling organisations through periods of rapid growth, organisational change or market expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy solving organisational and business problems, not just technical ones.You can balance strategy and execution, translating ambitious goals into tangible outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable making decisions in environments where there is rarely a perfect answer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong track record of building high-performing leadership teams and developing future leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are energised by the challenge of building something new and helping shape the future of Monzo&#39;s international expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After an informal ~30 min recruiter call our interview process involves 2 main stages:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Initial Call (1 hour)&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll meet with one of our senior engineering leaders. They&#39;ll ask you about your previous experience, in particular people leadership, product delivery and technical leadership. They’ll ask example based questions (‘Tell me about a time when…’)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Loop Stage&lt;/strong&gt; - This is one stage with 4 interviews (totalling 4 hours) split between a collaboration with one of our engineers on a technical exercise, as well as execution and leadership interviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At all stages we’ll create space for you to ask as many questions as you have, you’re interviewing us as well!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our average process takes around 3-4 weeks but we will always work around your availability. You will have the chance to speak to our recruitment team at various points during your process but if you do have any specific questions ahead of this please contact us on &lt;a ---------- Please also use that email to let us know if there&#39;s anything we can do to make your application process easier for you, because of disability, neurodiversity or any other personal reason.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we work 💻:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Locations &amp;amp; Flexible Working (If you&#39;re in the UK) :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our main tech hub is in London, but our engineers live everywhere in the UK— from Brighton to the Western Isles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value meeting in person but there’s no pressure to come into the office, even if you&#39;re nearby. We believe you&#39;ll do your best work if you are where you want to be. If you live outside of London and we ask you to come into the office, Monzo will support you with the costs. ✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our offices are naturally social, especially Tuesdays, Wednesdays and Thursdays, which happen to line up with our twice-weekly Monzo lunches &amp;amp; treat Thursdays 🍽️. Teams also schedule time together often for work and play – in or around the office, or online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set up a work schedule that delivers impact and fits your life.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Monzo, we value connections, flexibility, and wellbeing. We keep our meetings during core hours to stay connected and believe in maintaining work/life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be empowered to manage your work in a way that suits you and your team, giving you the freedom for children drop-offs and pick-ups, walking your dog or adventurous cat, avoiding peak commuting times or gym slots, appointments, or supporting your family in an emergency. 🕒✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work the way that works for you with Monzo! 💼&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✈️ We can help you relocate to the UK or Spain&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✅ We can sponsor visas for the UK (not Spain)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍This role can be based in our London office, but we&#39;re open to distributed working within the UK (with ad hoc meetings in London).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰ We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, at times that suit you and your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚Learning budget of £1,000 ( a year for books, training courses and conferences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-AL1 #LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunities for everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity and inclusion are a priority for us and we’re making sure we have lots of support for all of our people to grow at Monzo. At Monzo, we’re embracing diversity by fostering an inclusive environment for all people to do the best work of their lives with us. This is integral to our mission of making money work for everyone. You can read more in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/diversity-and-inclusion&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, 2026 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/our-2026-diversity-and-inclusion-report&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion Report&lt;/a&gt; and 2025 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/gender-pay-gap-report-2025&quot;&gt;Gender Pay Gap Report.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to age, ethnicity, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, or veteran, neurodiversity or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a preferred name, please use it to apply. We don&#39;t need full or birth names at application stage 😊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alnylam Pharmaceuticals is seeking an imaginative physician drug developer, with the flexibility and confidence to work across diseases within the neurology and hematology therapeutic area. &amp;nbsp;This role includes the opportunity to provide clinical leadership in developing RNAi therapeutics in Alnylam’s expanding portfolio, which spans from rare genetic to common diseases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate’s primary role will be one of the clinical study leads working on the plasminogen program transitioning from Phase 2 to Phase 3. The Director will report directly into the program clinical development strategy lead who provides the clinical research oversight of the program. The Director is expected to play a leading and influencing role in the overall clinical development strategies and drive progress and operational excellence of his/her clinical trial(s). This work will also involve extensive consultation and collaboration with external experts. The Director, Clinical Research, will work in a matrix organization across Regulatory, Biostatistics, Clinical Operations, Preclinical, Commercial &amp;amp; Quality Assurance teams to ensure fully harmonized and integrated development strategies. The Director will be a key Alnylam Development spokesperson at external meetings, including regulatory interactions and scientific meetings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a subject matter expert for the relevant disease area(s)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the strategic leader providing a strong, clear voice for the clinical program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop creative but realistic approaches to drug development and lead clinical efforts towards global regulatory approvals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversight of trial conduct and safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Preclinical, Regulatory Affairs and Medical Affairs to ensure tight strategic integration of product development plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable via Clinical Research and Operations for all relevant timelines and deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supervise closely all major written deliverables (regulatory submissions, original articles, abstracts), and presentation materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for final review and sign off with respect to all controlled documents including protocols, investigator brochures, and informed consent forms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence internal and external audiences in a high impact, highly visible fashion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A highly driven, dynamic, engaged and accomplished physician-scientist with experience and insight will thrive in this role. Specific qualifications include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MD with strong research background or MD PhD with best of class clinical and/or research training as shown through research support and peer-reviewed publications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Board Certification (or equivalent) or specialist training in neurology is desirable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years industry experience or equivalent clinical academic research experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound scientific and clinical judgment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with concepts of clinical research and clinical trials, including biostatistics, and regulatory agency organization, guidelines, and practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to effectively present ideas and document complex medical/clinical concepts in both written and oral communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;History of critical thinking and problem solving while exhibiting superior judgment and a balanced, realistic understanding of issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding leadership and collaboration skills working within a matrix environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in highly entrepreneurial biotech environment and embraces Alnylam’s culture of science, passion and urgency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Alnylam&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are the leader in RNAi therapeutics – a revolutionary approach with the potential to transform the lives of people with rare and common diseases. Built on Nobel Prize-winning science, Alnylam has delivered the breakthroughs that made RNAi therapeutics possible and are just at the beginning of what’s possible. Our deep pipeline, late-stage programs, and bold vision reflect our core values: fierce innovation, passion for excellence, purposeful urgency, open culture and commitment to people. We&#39;re proud to be a globally recognized top employer, where an authentic, inclusive culture and breakthrough thinking fuel one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Alnylam, we commit to an inclusive recruitment process and equal employment opportunity. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to their sex, gender or gender identity, sexual orientation, race, color, ethnicity, national origin, ancestry, citizenship, religion, creed, physical or mental disability, pregnancy status or related conditions, genetic information, veteran or military status, marital or familial status, political affiliation, age, or any other factor protected by federal, state, or local law. Alnylam is an E-Verify Employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before applying, please review Alnylam&#39;s ⁠Candidate&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://alnylampolicies.com/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;regarding how Alnylam handles Personal Data you provide with your application for employment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The pay range below reflects the full-time base salary range we expect to pay for this role at the time of posting. Base pay will be determined based on a number of factors including, but not limited to, relevant experience, skills, and education. This role is eligible for an annual short-term incentive award (e.g., bonus or sales incentive) and an annual long-term incentive award (e.g., equity).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alnylam’s robust Total Rewards package is designed to support your overall health and well-being. We offer comprehensive benefits including medical, dental, and vision coverage, life and disability insurance, a lifestyle reimbursement program, flexible spending and health savings accounts and a 401(k)with a generous company match. Eligible employees enjoy paid time off, wellness days, holidays, and two company-wide recharge breaks. We also offer generous family resources and leave. Our commitment to your well-being reflects our belief that caring for our people fuels the impact we create together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Learn more about these and additional benefits offered by Alnylam by visiting the Benefits section of the Careers website:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.alnylam.com/careers&quot;&gt;https://www.alnylam.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;U.S. Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$255,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$345,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are a global team of innovators and pioneers dedicated to shaping the future of observability. At New Relic, we build an intelligent platform that empowers companies to thrive in an AI-first world by giving them unparalleled insight into their complex systems. As we continue to expand our global footprint, we&#39;re looking for passionate people to join our mission. If you&#39;re ready to help the world&#39;s best companies optimize their digital applications, we invite you to explore a career with us!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Are you an exceptional sales leader ready for an unparalleled challenge? We are seeking a highly motivated and results-driven Sales Manager to pioneer and grow our Enterprise Sales organisation for the Northern European market, based out of UK. This role is a unique opportunity to design and lead a high-performing, Enterprise new business team from the ground up, making a significant contribution to our company’s trajectory. If you are passionate about talent development, thrive on change management, and believe in Hands-On Coaching, we want to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a defining career moment—a chance to build the foundations of a successful enterprise sales engine with a culture of excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Net-New Enterprise Focus:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive ambitious growth with a strategic focus on net-new logo acquisition and consistent, high-impact pipeline generation within large, complex enterprise accounts across Northern Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-On Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; We empower you to be a Hands-On Coach. Your management style will prioritise immediate, in-the-room mentorship and support, rather than relying solely on passive metrics or dashboards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unrivalled Development:&lt;/strong&gt; This role offers significant challenge and scope, providing accelerated professional growth and experiences that directly prepare you for future internal progression and promotion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for driving top-tier performance through expert coaching and meticulous operational oversight of complex sales cycles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coach for Performance:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide high-impact, day-to-day coaching, joining your Account Executives on calls and strategy sessions to navigate multi-stakeholder enterprise deals and significantly drive performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Set clear KPIs and lead the proactive territory planning required to ensure the team consistently overachieves on pipeline and revenue goals in the Southern European market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Rigor &amp;amp; Hygiene:&lt;/strong&gt; Instill the discipline required for diligent pipeline hygiene, ensuring the rigorous qualification and disqualification of opportunities to maintain a clean, high-value enterprise forecast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecasting &amp;amp; Data Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and maintain an accurate, reliable sales forecast for long-cycle deals. Leverage data analysis and trend spotting to provide insightful direction and measure rep performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deal Structure:&lt;/strong&gt; Instill discipline and clarity by ensuring rigorous application of the MEDDPPICC framework to effectively map out, structure, and close complex enterprise deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent Cultivation:&lt;/strong&gt; Attract, hire, and develop top-tier enterprise sales talent, mentoring them toward success and supporting their long-term career tenure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This Role Requires:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We seek an established sales leader ready for high accountability and strategic challenge.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in running high-performing &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise sales teams&lt;/strong&gt; with demonstrable success in a &lt;strong&gt;net-new acquisition&lt;/strong&gt; focus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with SaaS/Cloud environments and a proven ability to manage and coach reps through complex, long-cycle, multi-stakeholder deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional coaching and leadership skills, underpinned by a genuine desire to develop senior talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in the MEDDPPICC and COM sales methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical capability, using data and trends to measure performance, guide strategy, and accurately forecast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High levels of resilience, detail-orientation, and a proactive self-starter mentality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical command of Salesforce CRM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience in successfully building a sales team from scratch or managing a team through significant organisational change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A leadership philosophy rooted in Hands-On Coaching and presence over passive metrics tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A professional commitment to long-term tenure and sustained team growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;Please note that visa sponsorship is not available for this position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-RM1 #LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fostering a diverse, welcoming and inclusive environment is important to us. We work hard to make everyone feel comfortable bringing their best, most authentic selves to work every day. We celebrate our talented Relics’ different backgrounds and abilities, and recognize the different paths they took to reach us – including nontraditional ones. Their experiences and perspectives inspire us to make our products and company the best they can be. We’re looking for people who feel connected to our mission and values, not just candidates who check off all the boxes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you require a reasonable accommodation to complete any part of the application or recruiting process, please reach out to &lt;a ----- -----
&lt;p&gt;We believe in empowering all Relics to achieve professional and business success through a flexible workforce model. This model allows us to work in a variety of workplaces that best support our success, including fully office-based, fully remote, or hybrid.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In compliance with applicable law, all persons hired will be required to verify identity and eligibility to work and to complete employment eligibility verification. Note: Our stewardship of the data of thousands of customers means that a criminal background check is required to join New Relic.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We will consider qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records based on individual circumstances and in accordance with applicable law including, but not limited to, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://sfgov.org/olse/sites/default/files/FCO%20poster2020.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headhunters and recruitment agencies may not submit resumes/CVs through this website or directly to managers. New Relic does not accept unsolicited headhunter and agency resumes, and will not pay fees to any third-party agency or company that does not have a signed agreement with New Relic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;New Relic develops and distributes encryption software and technology that complies with U.S. export controls and licensing requirements. Certain New Relic roles require candidates to pass an export compliance assessment as a condition of employment in any global location. If relevant, we will provide more information later in the application process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates are evaluated based on qualifications, regardless of race, religion, ethnicity, national origin, sex, sexual orientation, gender expression or identity, age, disability, neurodiversity, veteran or marital status, political viewpoint, or other legally protected characteristics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Review our Applicant Privacy Notice at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://newrelic.com/termsandconditions/applicant-privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://newrelic.com/termsandconditions/applicant-privacy-policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;Set a new pulse for healthcare!&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Senior Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;DODO team&lt;/strong&gt; in the &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Platform domain&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Your mission will be to build and maintain the common building blocks of Doctolib&#39;s system with a &quot;Platform as a Product&quot; mindset, abstracting and simplifying complex, critical data infrastructure so that product teams can focus on what matters: building faster, better products for healthcare professionals and patients. You will work closely with 600+ engineers across 70+ teams, owning the vision and strategy for data management products that form the foundation of everything we build.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Working in the product team at Doctolib means building innovative products and features to improve the daily lives of care teams and patients. We operate in feature teams within an agile environment, collaborating closely with engineering, design, and business teams.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Own and align the 2-year vision for data storage at Doctolib, defining which datastore products we build, which we source off the shelf, and how they serve both the monolith and the growing ecosystem of services around it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Define the product strategy and roadmap for data management products used by 600+ engineers, spanning multiple datastores (PostgreSQL/Aurora, Kafka, Debezium, Couchbase), file storage, data access, and data lifecycle solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Drive reliability, recoverability, and cost transparency across teams, including SLOs, alert ownership, backup and restore testing, and per-team cost visibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Define the experience for managing production data for services outside the monolith and for new AI product storage needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Partner with Staff and Senior Staff Engineers to assess the impact of complex architectural decisions, facilitate consensus across diverse viewpoints, and align stakeholders on contested trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Measure and improve engineer satisfaction with data management products, leading projects end-to-end, from problem definition and specs writing to development validation, rollout, and impact follow-up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;Who you are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Before you read on: if you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have at least 5 years of experience in Product Management with direct product ownership, working with developers, leading rituals, and writing specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have extensive experience with technical products and platforms, and a passion for solving complex, large-scale infrastructure challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Can drive change across large engineering organizations, you&#39;re comfortable influencing 600+ engineers across more than 70 teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have proven experience building and launching products in a large-scale, international B2B environment, where moving fast without slowing down feature development is a constant challenge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Are fluent in both English and French (C1 level minimum) and are comfortable working in an international environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have an entrepreneurial mindset and the ambition to transform healthcare&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Free comprehensive health insurance (basic package) for you and your children&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;25 days of paid vacation per year, plus up to 14 days of RTT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Free mental health and coaching services through our partner Moka.care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Work from abroad for up to 10 days per year thanks to our flexibility days policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Lunch vouchers (Swile card) worth €8.50 per working day, with €4.50 covered by Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;A subsidy from the work council to refund part of the membership to a sport club or a creative class&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;50% reimbursement of your public transport subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;ParentCare Program: Enjoy full salary coverage (100%) during your first month of birth leave and 75% during the second, covered by Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Enrollment in Doctolib&#39;s long-term employee value sharing plan called DoctoGrowth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;For caregivers and workers with disabilities, a package including an adaptation of the remote policy, extra days off for medical reasons, and psychological support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Relocation support in case of international mobility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Access to the best AI tools for coding, development and dedicated training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;Our interview process&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Recruiter Interview (45m) - w Maxime&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Hiring Manager Interview (60m) - w Loïc&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Live-case Interview (90m)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Behavioral Interview (75m)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;At least one reference check&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;We want your experience to be clear, respectful, and transparent. Learn more about our hiring process on our &lt;a class=&quot;break-words font-semibold transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out hover:underline text-highlight hover:text-highlight-400 active:text-highlight-dark&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/getting-hired/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;candidate experience page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;Job details&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Permanent position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Full-time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Paris, France&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Hybrid work setup (up to 2 remote days per week)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Start date: as soon as possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;We welcome everyone&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This translates into our recruitment process. We evaluate candidates based solely on qualifications and motivation, without any form of discrimination.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the more our product will truly improve healthcare for all. You are welcome to apply to Doctolib, regardless of your gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, or disability.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;To ensure equal opportunities, we invite you to exclude personal information (e.g., pictures, age) from your applications. If you require any accommodation, please let us know for support during the hiring process.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;Your data privacy&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;All information provided is processed by Doctolib for application management. For data processing details, click here: &lt;a class=&quot;break-words font-semibold transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out hover:underline text-highlight hover:text-highlight-400 active:text-highlight-dark&quot; href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-FR&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;France&lt;/a&gt;. Please contact hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com for inquiries or to exercise your rights.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vous rejoindrez l&#39;équipe&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.doctolib.fr/prevention/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Doctolib Prévention&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;, une équipe d&#39;entrepreneur(euse)s qui construit une nouvelle activité depuis 2022 avec l&#39;ambition de transformer le système de santé vers plus de prévention. En participant à des missions très diversifiées aux côtés du Prevention Strategy Associate, vous contribuerez directement à accompagner l&#39;effort national de virage vers une médecine plus préventive et à donner aux patients les moyens de devenir acteurs de leur santé.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos missions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vos responsabilités incluent, mais ne sont pas limitées à :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Réaliser des analyses quantitatives et améliorer les outils de mesure (enquêtes, analyses comparatives) pour évaluer l’impact des campagnes de prévention et formuler des recommandations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mener des études de marché pour soutenir le développement de Doctolib Prévention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer à la priorisation de la roadmap produit et marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Préparer les reportings internes et coordonner avec les équipes (communication, affaires publiques, autres équipes).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimiser les processus internes et produire des supports (scripts, pitchs, présentations) pour l’équipe sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Les qualités attendues&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Avant de poursuivre votre lecture, si vous n&#39;avez pas le profil exact décrit ci-dessous, mais que vous pensez que cette description de poste correspond à vos compétences et à vos besoins, nous vous encourageons tout de même à postuler.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous pourrez être le prochain membre de notre équipe si vous :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Êtes étudiant.e en Master 1/2 en école de commerce ou d&#39;ingénieur, avec une spécialisation en stratégie, santé publique, ou data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Êtes à l&#39;aise avec la data, l&#39;analyse de données quantitatives et faites preuve de rigueur et d&#39;esprit de synthèse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avez un esprit entrepreneurial, une envie d&#39;apprendre et de vous impliquer dans un projet à impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Faites preuve d&#39;adaptabilité, de flexibilité et de qualités relationnelles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ce serait fantastique si :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous portez un intérêt fort pour la santé et/ou l&#39;innovation en santé&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous souhaitez monter en compétences sur des sujets variés : stratégie, data, marketing, opérations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous possédez une appétence pour le domaine des médias&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notre offre&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un programme d’onboarding complet, avec la Doctolib Academy et de nombreuses sessions de formation au sein de votre équipe (langues, soft skills, compétences techniques)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une carte Swile et de nombreuses offres de restauration au sein de nos locaux&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une offre de sport : un abonnement Urban Sports Club, des cours de sport gratuits dans les bureaux ou à distance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Le remboursement des titres de transport à 50%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;De nombreux bureaux offrant des espaces de collaboration et de bien-être&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une politique de travail flexible avec un mode hybride&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le processus de recrutement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un call RH avec Flore, Talent Partner (15 minutes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un entretien opérationnel avec Aabir Elakili, Prevention Strategy Lead (1 heure)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Détails du poste&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stage conventionné à temps plein&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Durée : 6 mois&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Début souhaité : mars 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lieu de travail : Levallois-Perret&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rémunération : À définir selon profil&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Doctolib, nous sommes convaincus que nous devons améliorer la santé pour tout le monde. Cela se reflète dans notre processus de recrutement. Nous évaluons les candidatures uniquement sur la base des qualifications et de la motivation, sans aucune forme de discrimination.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Plus les idées sont diverses, plus notre produit améliorera véritablement la santé pour tout le monde. Vous pouvez postuler chez Doctolib, quel que soit votre genre, religion, âge, orientation sexuelle, origine ethnique ou handicap.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Afin de garantir l&#39;égalité des chances, nous vous invitons à exclure les informations personnelles (par exemple : photos, âge) de vos candidatures. Si vous avez besoin d&#39;aménagements particuliers, merci de nous en informer pour que nous puissions adapter le processus de recrutement. Rejoignez-nous pour construire la santé dont nous rêvons tous !&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Toutes les informations fournies sont traitées par Doctolib pour la gestion des candidatures. Pour plus de détails sur le traitement des données, cliquez&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://media.doctolib.com/image/upload/mkg/file/privacy_notice_recrutement_fr_1.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;ici&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;. Veuillez contacter hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com pour toute question ou pour exercer vos droits.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;L&#39;équipe&amp;nbsp;Corporate Development recherche un(e) stagiaire pour un stage de 6 mois afin de contribuer aux réflexions stratégiques et financières de Doctolib et travailler sur de possibles opérations d’acquisition ou de levée de fonds. Rattachée au CFO et ayant de nombreuses interactions avec le Comex, l&#39;équipe intervient à l’intersection de la finance d’entreprise, de la stratégie et des relations investisseurs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos missions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que Corporate Development Analyst, vous serez pleinement intégré(e) dans l’équipe et&amp;nbsp; travaillerez en étroite collaboration avec l’ensemble de ses membres.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vos responsabilités incluent mais ne sont pas limitées à :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer aux réflexions stratégiques de Doctolib et à la préparation des présentations à destination du Comité Exécutif&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suivre l’activité des acteurs de l’écosystème digital health et tech (innovations, acquisitions, nouvelle géographie, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer à la transformation IA de l&#39;équipe : participation à la réflexion des workflows à automatiser, test et déploiement d’agents IA, mesure d’impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer aux exercices d’origination de cibles M&amp;amp;A et à l’exécution des deals M&amp;amp;A : valorisation de l’entreprise, participation au processus de due diligence, soutien à la préparation des documents de décisions du Comex et du Board, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Appuyer la gestion des relations investisseurs (présentes et futures) de Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Les qualités attendues pour ce poste&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Avant de poursuivre votre lecture, si vous n’avez pas le profil exact décrit ci-dessous, mais que vous pensez que cette description de poste correspond à vos compétences et à vos besoins, nous vous encourageons tout de même à postuler !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous pourrez être le prochain membre de notre équipe si:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous recherchez un stage de fin d&#39;études (niveau bac+5) ou de 2ème partie de césure, avec un background financier, commerce ou ingénieur – avec un fort angle analytique&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez une première expérience en Stratégie et / ou en Corporate Finance (cabinet de conseil, banque d’investissement, M&amp;amp;A corporate, VC, PE)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous savez faire preuve de leadership, d’autonomie dans votre travail et vous n’avez pas peur de prendre des initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous parlez couramment français, maîtrisez l’anglais professionnel &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous maîtrisez Excel et Powerpoint ou les équivalents sur la suite Google&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ce serait fantastique si :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez envie de travailler dans une entreprise tech &amp;amp; en forte croissance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
