&lt;p&gt;Si tu es passionné(e) par la data et que tu souhaites développer une double compétence en conseil et en technologie, envoie-nous ta candidature !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous recrutons nos collaborateurs uniquement en fonction de nos besoins et des qualités propres de chaque candidat. Nous assurons le développement de leurs compétences professionnelles et de leurs responsabilités sans discrimination d’aucune sorte. Le groupe s&#39;engage à reconnaître et promouvoir tous les talents, quels que soient leurs croyances, âge, handicap, parentalité, origine ethnique, nationalité, identité de genre, orientation sexuelle, appartenance à une organisation politique, religieuse, syndicale ou à une minorité, ou toute autre caractéristique qui pourrait faire l&#39;objet d&#39;une discrimination.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, our mission is simple: to change the way people eat, forever. As the Category Manager for Packaging, you will report directly to the Director of Packaging and take full ownership of creating and developing our Primary packaging category (ingredient packaging, plastic film…). You will be responsible for developing and executing sourcing strategies to improve our cost structure, the quality of our products, and the reliability of our supply chain, while playing a leading role in supporting innovation and new product development.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an ambitious, confident, and entrepreneurial procurement professional who can balance the analytical requirements of the role with the collaborative skills needed to elevate our customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: Source primary suppliers that can co-create and develop best-in-class primary packaging solutions tailored specifically to our unique business model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Execution&lt;/strong&gt;: Leverage large internal datasets and industry benchmarks (including market, supplier, and SKU analysis) to identify opportunities for cost reduction and implement best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop the Supply Base&lt;/strong&gt;: Build and maintain a strong pool of primary packaging suppliers capable of providing all of our ingredient packaging requirements, taking full ownership of vendor selection, specs definition, KPIs and relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elevate Customer Experience&lt;/strong&gt;: Work closely with the packaging design team to improve the overall look and feel of our ingredient packaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferably deep knowledge and interest in food, Ideally working within a similar environment and sector&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Masters degree in Supply Chain / Procurement / Business (or equivalent)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of strategic procurement / supply chain / consulting experience in operations practise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of entrepreneurial mindset, and ability to prioritize workload in a fast-paced environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quantitative and analytical experience, including solid comfort with the Gsuite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, flexible, ambitious, and assertive: you take ownership of your work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TRAVEL REQUIREMENTS: &lt;/strong&gt;10% - 25% (Flexible)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dans un souci de clarté et d’accessibilité, nous avons choisi de ne pas utiliser l’écriture inclusive dans nos communications. WPP Media est fermement engagé en faveur de la diversité : nous valorisons l&#39;inclusion et l&#39;égalité, en considérant tous les candidats sans distinction d&#39;identité de genre, d&#39;origine ethnique ou de religion. Tous nos postes sont également ouverts aux personnes en situation de handicap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;À propos de WPP Media :&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP est le partenaire de confiance des plus grandes marques mondiales pour assurer leur croissance. &lt;/strong&gt;Nous réunissons une intelligence média de pointe, une créativité de classe mondiale, une production de nouvelle génération, des solutions pour transformer le marketing à l’ère de l’IA et un conseil stratégique d’expert au sein d’une seule compagnie.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Propulsés par des talents exceptionnels et WPP Open, notre plateforme de marketing agentique, nous déployons l’IA à grande échelle pour aider nos clients à naviguer dans un monde en pleines mutations et à optimiser leurs investissements marketing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour plus d’informations, visitez &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wpp.com/&quot;&gt;www.wpp.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media est le collectif média global de WPP. Dans un monde où les médias sont omniprésents, nous regroupons la meilleure plateforme, les meilleurs talents et les meilleurs partenaires pour développer les solutions les plus innovantes, offrant une croissance inégalée à nos clients. Pour plus d&#39;informations, visitez &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez WPP Media, nous croyons en la puissance de notre culture et de nos collaborateurs. C&#39;est grâce à cette synergie que nous parvenons à créer des expériences véritablement exceptionnelles, tant pour nos clients que pour nos équipes internes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour réussir dans ce poste, il est fondamental d&#39;incarner les valeurs essentielles qui unissent WPP et WPP Media :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Être Extraordinaire&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;en favorisant un leadership collectif qui inspire une créativité véritablement transformationnelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Créer un environnement Ouvert&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;en trouvant l&#39;équilibre parfait entre l&#39;épanouissement de nos collaborateurs et la satisfaction de nos clients, le tout fondé sur une confiance mutuelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diriger avec Optimisme&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;en stimulant activement la croissance et le développement pour mobiliser l&#39;ensemble de notre organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Rôle et missions&amp;nbsp;: &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous prendrez la responsabilité du compte MGM au sein de l’équipe OpenDoor (entité qui gère l’ensemble des LOB d’Amazon au sein de WPP Media France).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sur ce portefeuille d&#39;envergure, nous recherchons un&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Business Director&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;– Client Lead &lt;/strong&gt;pour incarner le conseil de haut niveau, guider les recommandations stratégiques et accompagner la montée en compétences d&#39;une équipe pluridisciplinaire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vos missions principales :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Vision Stratégique, Écriture &amp;amp; Prise de Hauteur :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rédiger et porter les recommandations stratégiques globales et spécifique à chaque sortie cinéma en apportant une vraie prise de hauteur 360°.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concevoir des présentations et des synthèses stratégiques à fort impact destinées aux directions marketing, comités de direction, instances internationales et réseaux de partenaires/franchisés.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Valoriser, structurer et incarner avec conviction l&#39;ensemble des travaux produits par l&#39;agence pour sublimer la valeur délivrée aux clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Appétence Innovation &amp;amp; Développement de la Valeur Client :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Démontrer une forte curiosité et une appétence naturelle pour les sujets d&#39;innovation média et les enjeux stratégiques clés du moment :&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Influence &amp;amp; Content / Opérations Spéciales, Event…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dans une démarche conseil créatrice de valeur (et non de pur push commercial), savoir détecter dans les échanges clients les besoins émergents pour co-construire des solutions sur-mesure avec l&#39;appui des équipes d&#39;experts internes (Data, Studio, Activation).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Leadership Managérial &amp;amp; Coaching Orienté Développement :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Encadrer et animer une équipe (Account Directors, Account Managers, Executives, Alternants).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;S&#39;appuyer sur la forte autonomie de l&#39;équipe dans la gestion opérationnelle du quotidien pour adopter une posture de&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;mentor et de coach&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifier les axes de progression individuels — notamment sur la prise de hauteur stratégique, l&#39;écriture et la formalisation des recommandations — et accompagner le développement des collaborateurs seniors pour les aider à franchir des caps majeurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Coordination 360 &amp;amp; Orchestration Interne :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer l&#39;orchestration globale des réponses plurimédias (Online &amp;amp; Offline) en faisant le lien fluide entre le conseil, le planning stratégique, la création et les équipes d&#39;activation technique (Social, Programmatique, TV/Vidéo).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Profil Recherché :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;10 à 12 ans d&#39;expérience en agence média sur des fonctions de conseil, de stratégie média et de relation client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expertise dans l’industrie du Cinéma&lt;/strong&gt;, idéalement ayant déjà piloté un compte Entertainment (distributeur cinéma).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expertise Média 360 :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Solide culture générale des médias (Off &amp;amp; Online).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualités Rédactionnelles &amp;amp; Synthèse :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Excellence reconnue dans la réflexion et l&#39;écriture stratégique, capacité à simplifier des problématiques complexes et à porter des dossiers stratégiques de haut niveau.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Posture Managériale :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; Capacité avérée à faire progresser ses équipes par l&#39;accompagnement et le coaching plutôt que par le micro-management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Langues :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Anglais professionnel obligatoire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;La vie chez WPP Media et ses avantages :&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre engagement à façonner l&#39;avenir des médias se manifeste par un soutien actif au développement professionnel de nos talents, les aidant à atteindre leur plein potentiel. Cette démarche s&#39;accompagne d&#39;une vision responsable dans nos stratégies d&#39;investissement médiatique, reflétant ainsi notre double priorité : valoriser nos collaborateurs tout en adoptant des pratiques durables dans notre secteur.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Les collaborateurs de WPP Media ont un accès privilégié aux réseaux internationaux de WPP Media et WPP, leur permettant de développer leurs passions, d&#39;étendre leur réseau professionnel et de rester à la pointe des innovations en marketing et publicité.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous disposons de ressources vastes et variées au service de nos collaborateurs, notre entreprise cultive activement l&#39;inclusion des talents de tous horizons. Les réussites et expertises des équipes sont régulièrement mises en lumière lors d&#39;événements fédérateurs qui ponctuent également les moments clés de l&#39;année, renforçant ainsi notre culture d&#39;entreprise collaborative et diversifiée.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nos avantages comprennent :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Télétravail :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;jusqu&#39;à 2 jours par semaine et 2 semaines complètes à prendre en deux fois dans l’année.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Congés offerts :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;2 jours de repos supplémentaires offerts, dont le lundi de Pentecôte.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ancienneté :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Jours de congé additionnels par palier de 5 ans d’ancienneté.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Santé &amp;amp; Équité :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;5 jours de télétravail additionnels par mois pour les collaboratrices souffrant d’endométriose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Politique handicap :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;3 jours d&#39;absence autorisés payés par an, accès à des Chèques Emploi Service Universel, et accompagnements spécifiques pour les collaborateurs ayant une RQTH.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engagement sociétal :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Missions solidaires possibles via le programme&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;We care and we act&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tools :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Accès à des outils performants et à la pointe de la technologie pour la gestion des campagnes et le reporting (WPP Open).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Process de recrutement :&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous nous engageons à rendre ce process aussi rapide et efficace que possible, et à maintenir une communication ouverte et transparente tout au long du process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entretien avec l’équipe Recrutement :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Un premier entretien téléphonique ou par vidéoconférence avec l’équipe Talent pour aborder votre parcours et échanger sur le poste.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entretiens Opérationnels :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Une rencontre avec les leads des comptes à gérer. Au moins un entretien physique est prévu dans nos locaux.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Étude de cas :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Réalisation d&#39;un Business Case stratégique pour évaluer votre capacité d&#39;analyse, de synthèse, la qualité de votre écriture et votre vision média.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media garantit l&#39;égalité des chances et considère tous les candidats sans discrimination ni considération de caractéristiques particulières. Nous nous engageons à cultiver un environnement de respect où chacun se sent à sa place et bénéficie des mêmes opportunités d&#39;évolution professionnelle. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Consultez notre politique de confidentialité pour tout savoir sur la protection de vos données &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;politique de confidentialité&lt;/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bien que nous étudiions toutes les candidatures reçues, nous ne contactons que les personnes sélectionnées pour un entretien.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#&lt;span class=&quot;mark1c5ktfqef&quot; data-markjs=&quot;true&quot; data-ogac=&quot;&quot; data-ogab=&quot;&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;&quot; data-ogsbtc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsbrc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsbbc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsblc=&quot;&quot;&gt;LI&lt;/span&gt;-&lt;span class=&quot;markdz0rokyru&quot; data-markjs=&quot;true&quot; data-ogac=&quot;&quot; data-ogab=&quot;&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;&quot; data-ogsbtc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsbrc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsbbc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsblc=&quot;&quot;&gt;Promoted&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Samsara (NYSE: IOT) is the pioneer of the Connected Operations™ Cloud, which is a platform that enables organizations that depend on physical operations to harness Internet of Things (IoT) data to develop actionable insights and improve their operations. At Samsara, we are helping improve the safety, efficiency and sustainability of the physical operations that power our global economy. Representing more than 40% of global GDP, these industries are the infrastructure of our planet, including agriculture, construction, field services, transportation, and manufacturing — and we are excited to help digitally transform their operations at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Working at Samsara means you’ll help define the future of physical operations and be on a team that’s shaping an exciting array of product solutions, including Video-Based Safety, Vehicle Telematics, Apps and Driver Workflows, and Equipment Monitoring. As part of a recently public company, you’ll have the autonomy and support to make an impact as we build for the long term.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Development Representative (ADR) at Samsara, you will be trained, both on the job and with formal training programs led by a world-class team of sales professionals, to take on your next role as closing Account Executive.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On a daily basis, you will be responsible for sourcing pipelines for our French EMEA business, generating opportunities via outbound outreach.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have offices in Paris and London and we offer remote working from France and the United Kingdom.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a remote position open to candidates based in France and the United Kingdom. This position requires working hours in CET. Relocation assistance will not be provided for this role.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You should apply if:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You want to impact the industries that run our world: &lt;/strong&gt;Your efforts will result in real-world impact—helping to keep the lights on, get food into grocery stores, and most importantly, ensure workers return home safely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are the architect of your own career: &lt;/strong&gt;If you put in the work, this role won’t be your last at Samsara. Successful ADRs can see promotion to a closing role in two years or less.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You love talking to people: &lt;/strong&gt;In this role, you will average 60+ calls to prospective customers daily.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have an innate curiosity about how businesses work: &lt;/strong&gt;One day you’ll meet with someone in waste management and the next you may be learning about the inner workings of a food distribution center. Our top sales team members seek to learn the ins and outs of the businesses they support to make a larger impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You treat rejection as a learning experience:&lt;/strong&gt; In this role, you will get hung up on and you will get told no. You need to have the resilience to pick up the phone again and again to sell Samsara’s mission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You want to be with the best: &lt;/strong&gt;Samsara’s high-performance Sales culture means you’ll be surrounded by the best and challenged to go farther than you have before.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive pipeline through personalised outreach to prospects via phone, emails and LinkedIn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have the opportunity to to participate in trade/shows events to represent the Samsara brand and connect with prospective customers and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a product expert and learn the Samsara way of selling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep meticulous records of interactions with accounts in our CRM (Salesforce.com)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion, role model, and embed Samsara’s cultural principles (Focus on Customer Success, Build for the Long Term, Adopt a Growth Mindset, Be Inclusive, Win as a Team) as we scale globally and across new offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements for the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-3 years professional experience, ideally in customer facing roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6-12 months sales experience as a minimum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly motivated and committed, with strong desire to work in target driven sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of consistent over achievement of targets/expectations of previous roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, verbal and written&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious and able to ask insightful questions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A champion of a Growth Mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly proficient in English and fluent in French&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An ideal candidate also has:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in closing-sales roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of achievements beyond work (e.g. academics, sports, charity, …)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to collaborate and influence in a “win as a team” environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excitement about solving new problems in innovative ways&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivation to help build a fast-growing business in the IoT and SaaS space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADR pathways&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Through Samsara’s ADR program, there are always opportunities to move to the next level and take on more responsibility during the program and beyond—those who work hard to grow quickly will have the opportunity to advance their careers. With emphasis on continued professional development, the training doesn&#39;t stop after onboarding—we provide opportunities to expand ADRs’ understanding of the market and our competitors, develop hard skills needed in the Sales function, and work with mentors to help our representatives progress through the three levels of our ADR program.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADR I&lt;/strong&gt; representatives focus on inbound leads—conducting a high volume of conversations, sharing the ins and outs of our products, and fostering relationships with those prospects interested in Samsara. At the ADR I level, we provide plenty of learning opportunities including call sessions with more senior Sales team members, training on tools (Salesforce, Salesloft, Lusha), product knowledge, objection handling, and more. Our representatives at this level are go-getters who are able to progress their careers through the opportunities provided for them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The next level in the program is &lt;strong&gt;ADR II&lt;/strong&gt;, where our representatives work on top of funnel movement, creating high quality sales engagements, and supporting our Account Executives. Along with the leap into outbound work, those at the ADR II level are continually exposed to learning opportunities and enrolled in specialized trainings including professional writing, persona based messaging, , cold calling 2.0, and collaboration and communication with Account Executives. After building their skills in outbound sales and earning sales certifications, our representatives graduate to the final level of the program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The highest level within our organization is &lt;strong&gt;ADR III&lt;/strong&gt;. These ADRs work hand-in-hand with field Account Executives and Enterprise Regional Sales Managers at Samsara. They partner closely on large accounts, implementing detailed territory plans, participating in weekly strategy meetings, and scheduling and attending customer demos. Additionally, ADR IIIs partake in a mentorship program to learn from leadership on the Account Executive team who provide exposure and training ahead of their interview for an Account Executive position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please submit an English CV with your application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Total Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Samsara, we build for the people who keep the global economy moving. We want owners, not passengers, which is why &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.samsara.com/company/careers/benefits&quot;&gt;our rewards&lt;/a&gt; are designed to fuel high-impact builders. Our compensation program delivers above-market total compensation through a combination of base salary, performance-based bonus/variable pay, and equity (for eligible roles) in a high-growth public company. We meaningfully differentiate pay for our top performers, who have the opportunity to earn above-market compensation that can outpace the broader market over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond compensation, we provide the foundations that enable long-term success: a flexible, employee-led remote model, a professional development stipend, comprehensive health and parental leave plans, and more. If you’re ready to build for the long term and own the outcome, your journey starts here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Samsara, we embrace a flexible working model that caters to the diverse needs of our teams. Our offices are open for those who prefer to work in-person and we also support remote work where it aligns with our operational requirements. For certain positions, being close to one of our offices or within a specific geographic area is important to facilitate collaboration, access to resources, or alignment with our service regions. In these cases, the job description will clearly indicate any working location requirements. Our goal is to ensure that all members of our team can contribute effectively, whether they are working on-site, in a hybrid model, or fully remotely. All offers of employment are contingent upon an individual’s ability to secure and maintain the legal right to work at the company and in the specified work location, if applicable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Belonging at Samsara&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Samsara, we welcome everyone regardless of their background. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, national origin, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, protected veteran status, disability, age, and other characteristics protected by law. We depend on the unique approaches of our team members to help us solve complex problems and want to ensure that Samsara is a place where people from all backgrounds can make an impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is an inclusive work environment, and we are committed to ensuring equal opportunity in employment for qualified persons with disabilities. Please email &lt;a ---------- or &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/DrM6DFQUiSgfPtCVA&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; if you require any reasonable accommodations throughout the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Authenticity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use &lt;a href=&quot;https://hiretofu.com/privacyPolicy&quot;&gt;Tofu&lt;/a&gt;, a fraud detection tool, to validate the authenticity of applications and protect against identity fraud. This ensures we are connecting with real people and allows us to prioritize genuine candidates. Please see Samsara’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.samsara.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraudulent Employment Offers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is aware of scams involving fake job interviews and offers. Please know we do not charge fees to applicants at any stage of the hiring process. Official communication about your application will only come from emails ending in ----- ----- or ----- For more information regarding fraudulent employment offers, please visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://samsara.com/blog/avoiding-fake-job-offers&quot;&gt;blog post here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

About Bazaarvoice
&nbsp;
At Bazaarvoice, we create smart shopping experiences. Through our expansive global network, product-passionate community &amp; enterprise technology, we connect thousands of brands and retailers with billions of consumers. Our solutions enable brands to connect with consumers and collect valuable user-generated content, at an unprecedented scale. This content achieves global reach by leveraging our extensive and ever-expanding retail, social &amp; search syndication network. And we make it easy for brands &amp; retailers to gain valuable business insights from real-time consumer feedback with intuitive tools and dashboards. The result is smarter shopping: loyal customers, increased sales, and improved products.
&nbsp;
The problem we are trying to solve : Brands and retailers struggle to make real connections with consumers. It's a challenge to deliver trustworthy and inspiring content in the moments that matter most during the discovery and purchase cycle. The result? Time and money spent on content that doesn't attract new consumers, convert them, or earn their long-term loyalty.
&nbsp;
Our brand promise : closing the gap between brands and consumers.
&nbsp;
Founded in 2005, Bazaarvoice is headquartered in Austin, Texas with offices in North America, Europe, Asia and Australia.
&nbsp;
It’s official: Bazaarvoice is a&nbsp;Great Place to Work&nbsp;in the&nbsp;US&nbsp;,&nbsp;Australia,&nbsp;India, Lithuania, France, Germany and the&nbsp;UK!
Bazaarvoice is looking for an extraordinarily talented, high-performing Account Executive to join our EMEA sales team. This role is designed for a unique, new-business hunter who craves a challenge, thrives outside their comfort zone, and possesses the strategic rigor to manage a high-value retail territory across Southern Europe.&nbsp;
As an Account Executive for Strategic Retail, you will build a pipeline and drive the sales cycle from start to finish. If you are a consultative storyteller who can navigate complex enterprise organizations, build consensus, and defend a high-ROI solution to C-level executives, we want to hear from you.
Key Responsibilities:


Orchestrate the Territory Ecosystem: Act as the strategic leader of your territory. Conduct account planning, territory management, and continuous pipeline generation, while rallying internal cross-functional resources to maximize coverage and close deals.


End-to-End Deal Architecture: Manage the entire lifecycle of high-value enterprise SaaS deals—from initial prospecting and precise qualification to sophisticated contract negotiation and closure.


Strategic Opportunity Mapping: Move beyond standard discovery to conduct deep-dive analyses into a retailer's business model. Reveal latent pain points and align Bazaarvoice’s high-ROI solutions with their business objectives.


Value Defense &amp; Executive Presence: Partner with a prospect’s marketing, merchandising, and technology staff. Confidently demonstrate and defend the ROI of our platform, successfully building consensus from Marketing Managers up to CMO, CTO, and Procurement levels.


High-Velocity Discipline &amp; Forecasting: Drive urgency throughout the sales funnel, handle objections with resilience, and maintain a high volume of outbound activity. Deliver exceptional qualification and accurate forecasting over a two-quarter period.


Thought Leadership: Stay ahead of e-commerce industry trends, competitor movements, and shifts in consumer behavior to provide proactive strategic guidance.


What You'll Bring:


Proven Track Record: 3 year experience in a customer-facing, new-business SaaS hunter role, with a proven history of managing high-value portfolios and consistently exceeding quotas.


Retail &amp; Digital Savvy: Strong knowledge of and experience selling into large, complex retail organizations.


Strategic &amp; Financial Acumen: Expert in value-selling innovative software in a fast-changing space. Ability to articulate complex ROI models and use data-driven storytelling to win complex "consensus" buys.


Collaborative Leadership: Demonstrated ability to lead internal support teams, articulate a clear account strategy, and secure the internal resources needed to win.


The Bazaarvoice DNA: A high level of enthusiasm, coachability, and an unwavering work ethic. You are comfortable hearing "no," shaking it off, and pivoting your strategy to find the "yes."

Language: French language proficiency at Native or C1 minimum.

Right to Work: Eligibility to work in France without restrictions.


Desirable Criteria:


Industry Background: 3+ years of experience selling e-commerce, MarTech, or digital marketing technology, with established relationships up to the CMO level.


Brand Experience: Experience selling to large consumer brands in addition to major retailers.


Global Mindset: Additional European language skills are a strong plus.


Key Performance Indicators (KPIs)


Net New Revenue: Driving net new business within the Retail segment.


Pipeline Velocity &amp; Accuracy: Consistently generating pipeline and moving opportunities through the funnel with speed and precise forecasting.


Cross-Functional Leadership: Successfully leveraging and orchestrating your internal support resources to maximize territory efficiency and deal sizes.


Why join Bazaarvoice?
&nbsp;
Customer is key
We see our own success through our customers’ outcomes.&nbsp;&nbsp;
We approach every situation with a customer first mindset.
&nbsp;
Transparency &amp; Integrity&nbsp;Builds Trust
We believe in the power of authentic feedback because it’s in our DNA.&nbsp;
We do the right thing when faced with hard choices.&nbsp;Transparency and trust accelerate our collective performance.
&nbsp;
Passionate Pursuit of Performance
Our energy is contagious, because we hire for passion, drive &amp; curiosity.&nbsp;
We love what we do, and because we’re laser focused on our mission.
&nbsp;
Innovation over Imitation
We seek to innovate as we are not content with the status quo.&nbsp;
We embrace agility and experimentation as an advantage.
&nbsp;
Stronger Together
We bring our whole selves to the mission and find value in diverse perspectives.&nbsp;
We champion what’s best for Bazaarvoice before individuals or teams.&nbsp;&nbsp;
As a stronger company we build a stronger community.
&nbsp;

&nbsp;
Want to see our culture in action?&nbsp;Explore our global&nbsp;Linkedin Life Page,&nbsp;Life at Bazaarvoice&nbsp;to see the bigger picture, or visit our&nbsp;EMEA Life Page&nbsp;to meet our regional teams and see what life is like in our local offices.&nbsp;

&nbsp;
&nbsp;
Commitment to diversity and inclusion
&nbsp;Bazaarvoice provides equal employment opportunities (EEO) to all team members and applicants according to their experience, talent, and qualifications for the job without regard to race, color, national origin, religion, age, disability, sex (including pregnancy, gender stereotyping, and marital status), sexual orientation, gender identity, genetic information, military/veteran status, or any other category protected by federal, state, or local law in every location in which the company has facilities. Bazaarvoice believes that diversity and an inclusive company culture are key drivers of creativity, innovation and performance. Furthermore, a diverse workforce and the maintenance of an atmosphere that welcomes versatile perspectives will enhance our ability to fulfill our vision of creating the world’s smartest network of consumers, brands, and retailers.
&nbsp;
&nbsp;
Please note that a background check forms part of our final hiring process. In compliance with local regulations, this will be conducted with your consent and will strictly focus on information relevant to the position.Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pure Storage is seeking a Strategic Accounts Account Executive to accelerate growth of the Portworx platform across Strategic Telco accounts in EMEA. You will own a small number of named Telco customers and prospects, build and execute multi year account plans, and drive platform adoption with a focus on business outcomes such as resilience, risk reduction, faster application delivery, and operational efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with cross functional teams across Pure and Portworx, including Systems Engineering, Customer Experience, Marketing, Partner teams, Product, and field leadership. This is a high impact individual contributor role with a strong emphasis on strategic planning, disciplined execution, and customer intimacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and grow a portfolio of named Strategic Telco accounts, delivering against annual and multi year revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute account plans that map buying centres, application priorities, Kubernetes roadmaps, and transformation programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop executive relationships across CIO, CTO, CISO, Head of Infrastructure, Platform Engineering, SRE, and Application leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex sales cycles from discovery through close, including security, risk, procurement, architecture review, and legal processes common in Telco.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position Portworx around measurable outcomes: application resilience, ransomware recovery, data protection, regulatory compliance, cloud portability, and modernisation at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate account teams and partner ecosystems, including GSIs, cloud providers, and regional partners, to drive pipeline creation and deal execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run a rigorous, value based sales process tailored to cloud native software, with accurate forecasting and strong hygiene in Salesforce and forecasting tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Customer Experience to expand adoption post sale, identify expansion triggers, and build customer advocacy within the Telco community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of competitive dynamics in Kubernetes data services, backup and recovery, and container storage, using insights to sharpen strategy and messaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Portworx in customer meetings and relevant industry events, with a field first mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven enterprise software sales experience, with a track record of closing and expanding high value, multi stakeholder deals in large organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience selling into Telco, with an understanding of procurement, governance, risk, and security requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grasp of cloud native concepts and the Kubernetes ecosystem, plus the ability to credibly engage architects and platform teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to both technical and executive stakeholders, translating technical capabilities into business value and risk outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disciplined pipeline generation, qualification, deal management, and forecasting, with strong operational habits in SFDC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working in a matrixed environment, influencing cross functional teams without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and programme management skills, with clear account planning and stakeholder alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A customer first mindset and a bias for action, with resilience and curiosity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/&quot;&gt;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/ &lt;/a&gt;for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACCOMMODATIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates with disabilities may request accommodations for all aspects of our hiring process. For more on this, contact us at &lt;a ---------- if you’re invited to an interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO A STRONG AND INCLUSIVE TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re forging a future where everyone finds their rightful place and where every voice matters. Where uniqueness isn’t just accepted but embraced. That’s why we are committed to fostering the growth and development of every person, cultivating a sense of community through our Employee Resource Groups and advocating for inclusive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, sexual stereotypes, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or any other characteristic legally protected by the laws of the jurisdiction in which you are being considered for hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us and bring your best.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring your bold.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure and simple.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Okta: The World’s Identity Company™&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Okta &amp;amp; The TAM Team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Okta is the leader in Identity management and The World’s Identity Company™. Our mission is to build a more secure world by providing a neutral, powerful, and extensible platform that puts identity at the heart of the modern tech stack—securing customers, employees, partners, and AI agents. Two-thirds of the Fortune 100 trust Okta to power their identity journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Technical Account Management (TAM) team is a global group of Okta product experts dedicated to driving long-term customer success. As a Senior TAM within our Strategic Workforce Identity segment, you will serve as the premier technical advisor and advocate for some of our largest enterprise customers (across Financial Services, Healthcare, Public Sector, and more), helping them elevate their technical maturity and maximize their Okta investment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;1. Strategic Customer Partnership &amp;amp; Influence&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trusted Advisor: Build deep, executive-level relationships, serving as the primary technical point of contact for customer identity owners and IT leadership (up to CxO).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Roadmapping: Architect tailored technical success plans aligned with customer business objectives to drive platform adoption and secure Okta against competitive displacement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adoption &amp;amp; Expansion: Guide customers in expanding their Okta footprint across critical Workforce solutions, continuously improving their overall security posture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;2. Complex Problem Resolution &amp;amp; Advocacy&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Escalation Lead: Independently manage and resolve highly complex customer technical escalations, collaborating with Customer Success Managers (CSMs) as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risk Mitigation: Proactively identify technical roadblocks, design robust mitigation plans, and drive them to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Advocacy: Champion customer needs internally by collaborating with Okta Engineering, Product, and Support teams to influence product direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;3. Thought Leadership &amp;amp; Team Enablement&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge Sharing: Deliver workshops, best practice sessions, and vertical-specific insights to enhance customer security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Asset Creation: Author repeatable technical strategies and assets to level up the global TAM organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentorship: Actively mentor and develop peer TAMs to upskill technical capabilities across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Workforce Identity Solutions You Will Support&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will provide deep technical guidance across Okta&#39;s comprehensive Workforce Identity lifecycle:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IAM: SSO, Adaptive MFA, Device Access, API Access Management, Secure Partner Access, Access Gateway, and Universal Directory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IGA: Lifecycle Management and Okta Identity Governance (OIG).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PAM: Privileged Access Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ITDR: Identity Security Posture Management and Identity Threat Protection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring to the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Education&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of related professional IT experience (or 6+ years with a Master’s degree).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience as a TAM, Technical Consultant, Solution Architect, or Product Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience working with Identity &amp;amp; Access Management (IAM) solutions or related security technologies is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education: BA/BS/MS in Computer Science, IT, or a related discipline (or equivalent experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certifications: Okta Certified, CISSP, or equivalent certifications are highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Technical Mastery (Workforce Identity Focus)&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Okta Architecture: Extensive hands-on proficiency mapping Okta feature sets to complex enterprise architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Federation Protocols: Strong understanding of modern identity protocols (SAML 2.0, OAuth, OpenID Connect, WS-Fed).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid Environments: Experience integrating legacy/non-standard applications that do not support modern federation protocols.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lifecycle &amp;amp; Provisioning: Deep knowledge of lifecycle management, automated provisioning, and integrations (e.g., SCIM, Okta Workflows, HR-driven provisioning, Active Directory).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SaaS Ecosystems: Familiarity deploying and securing key SaaS platforms (O365, Salesforce, Workday, Box).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Code Proficiency: Ability to read and modify existing quickstarts, code samples, or scripts to match customer requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Leadership&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive Presence: Exceptional communication skills with a proven ability to translate highly technical concepts into clear business outcomes for CxO-level audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Boundary Setting: Skilled at managing expectations, tracking portfolio health metrics, and setting healthy boundaries with internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;xt0psk2 x1ghz6dp x1717udv x1wty727 x4gjf66 x15eiy0f x1lziwak x15472z4 x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1s688f x14rh7hd xdj266r&quot; data-d-component=&quot;text&quot; data-d-inline=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;Location&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;Language&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;Requirements:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;This&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;is&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;hybrid&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;role,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;open&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;to&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;candidates&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;based&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;London,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;Munich,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;Paris,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;or&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;Warsaw.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;Fluency&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;both&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;German&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;English&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;is&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;mandatory.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-MM1&lt;br&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;br&gt;P26230_3599521&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Okta Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://rewards.okta.com&quot;&gt;Supporting Your Well-Being&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/okta-for-good/&quot;&gt;Driving Social Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/talent-connection-community/&quot;&gt;Developing Talent and Fostering Connection + Community&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are intentional about connection. Our global community, spanning over 20 offices worldwide, is united by a drive to innovate. Your journey begins with an immersive, in-person onboarding experience designed to accelerate your impact and connect you to our mission and team from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Okta is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, marital status, age, physical or mental disability, or status as a protected veteran. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and convictions records, consistent with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If reasonable accommodation is needed to complete any part of the job application, interview process, or onboarding please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1EfiEYZrIyhA2X4Fijk0R3RKYOzNoS3wtvyM4nhbZnXE/edit&quot;&gt;use this Form&lt;/a&gt; to request an accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notice for New York City Applicants &amp;amp; Employees: Okta may use Automated Employment Decision Tools (AEDT), as defined by New York City Local Law 144, that use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or other automated processes to assist in our recruitment and hiring process. In accordance with NYC Local Law 144, if you are an applicant or employee residing in New York City, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://talent.okta.com/new-york-city-aedt-notice.html&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to view our full NYC AEDT Notice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Okta is an identity company. Identity matters because we’re all unique. We were raised in different countries, cities, and towns. We have unique backgrounds. We’ve faced specific challenges. And we&#39;ve learned a lot along the way. At Okta we believe those experiences equip us to look at the world with our own perspective. Our SaaS product protects your right to be you, and we want every single one of our employees to feel a sense of belonging, acceptance and comfort to express their ideas, because ultimately our differences are what makes us great. And guess what? You could join us because…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Enterprise Sales team in France is growing!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Okta EMEA’s enterprise sales organisation are a team of entrepreneurial and driven sales professionals and they are playing a key role in the expansion of Okta as we establish ourselves as a market leader in the French territory, leveraging Okta’s existing customer references, marketing programs, partner base and ISV &amp;amp; alliance relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Enterprise Account Executive will focus on user base accounts between 5000 and 20000 base accounts and develop strategies and sales tactics to generate pipeline and drive sales opportunities to produce repeatable and predictable bookings, while adhering to Okta’s core value of always focusing on the success of our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As an Okta Enterprise Account Executive you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build your territory planning based on pipeline reconciliation plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with your internal ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationship with Okta partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute sales strategies and tactics to generate pipeline, drive sales opportunities and deliver repeatable and predictable bookings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace to Okta’s #1 core value to always love our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generating new business with the world’s largest organisations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position Okta at both the functional and business value level with target stakeholders;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion Okta to prospective clients at sales presentations, site visits and product demonstrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build effective working partnerships with your Okta colleagues (channel partners, sales engineering, business value management, customer first + many more!) with humility and enthusiasm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You could be a great fit for this role if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for technology and how it can help organisations compete and thrive in the Digital Age;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excitement about the opportunity to join the French territory arm of an exciting and fast-growing SaaS provider;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of success selling a Software-as-a-Service and/or Cloud Computing services to the largest and most complex organisations in the French territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in value-based selling at senior/C-Level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A reputation as a trusted business partner for you peers in the local reseller and system integrator community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communications skills;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to travel, including customer &amp;amp; partner sites, and visits to our EMEA HQ in London, and the US&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You might also have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of and experience with Identity &amp;amp; Access Management, Single Sign-on and API-based solutions is always great but definitely not a must have&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BSc/BA degree or equivalent (preferred but not essential)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI_Onsite&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;P25017_3401362&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Below is the annual On Target Compensation (OTE) range for candidates located in France. Your actual OTE, which is inclusive of base salary and incentive compensation, will depend on factors such as your skills, qualifications, experience, and work location. In addition, Okta offers equity (where applicable) and comprehensive healthcare coverage and financial benefits including paid time off and parental leave in accordance with our applicable plans and policies. To learn more about our Total Rewards program please visit: https://rewards.okta.com/fra.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The OTE range for this position for candidates located in France is between:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€168.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€231.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Okta Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://rewards.okta.com&quot;&gt;Supporting Your Well-Being&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/okta-for-good/&quot;&gt;Driving Social Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/talent-connection-community/&quot;&gt;Developing Talent and Fostering Connection + Community&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are intentional about connection. Our global community, spanning over 20 offices worldwide, is united by a drive to innovate. Your journey begins with an immersive, in-person onboarding experience designed to accelerate your impact and connect you to our mission and team from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Okta is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, marital status, age, physical or mental disability, or status as a protected veteran. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and convictions records, consistent with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If reasonable accommodation is needed to complete any part of the job application, interview process, or onboarding please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1EfiEYZrIyhA2X4Fijk0R3RKYOzNoS3wtvyM4nhbZnXE/edit&quot;&gt;use this Form&lt;/a&gt; to request an accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notice for New York City Applicants &amp;amp; Employees: Okta may use Automated Employment Decision Tools (AEDT), as defined by New York City Local Law 144, that use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or other automated processes to assist in our recruitment and hiring process. In accordance with NYC Local Law 144, if you are an applicant or employee residing in New York City, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://talent.okta.com/new-york-city-aedt-notice.html&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to view our full NYC AEDT Notice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who/What is Artefact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in data, digital, and analytics to help clients achieve tangible business impact. With 2,000+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 26 countries, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. At our German offices, we are on a rapid growth trajectory, advising leading national and international clients cross-industry on how to unlock the full potential of their data, build scalable data architectures, and implement cutting-edge AI solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Consultant (m/f/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;, you will sit at the center of this mission. You won&#39;t just deliver static slides; you will bridge the gap between technical possibilities and business imperatives, guiding clients from a focused short-term engagement with &lt;em&gt;Mittelstand&lt;/em&gt; manufacturers to multi-phase AI transformations with enterprises. In this role, you will take ownership of cross-functional workstreams, drive data-driven decision-making, and actively shape the digital future of our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client advisory &amp;amp; strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with (international) clients to understand their business needs and translate them into data-driven recommendations that support strategic decision-making and business transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Collect, synthesise and iterate data to create actionable insights. You work with a modern, AI-native toolstack - from LLM-powered environments (e.g. Claude, Gemini, ChatGPT) and agentic workflow tools (e.g. n8n, Lovable) to coding assistants and automation platforms - and communicate findings clearly to both technical and non-technical stakeholders. Familiarity with SQL or Python remains a plus, but the ability to leverage AI tools to accelerate analysis and delivery is what we value most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Take ownership of project workstreams and ensure high-quality, timely delivery in alignment with overall project goals. Work collaboratively within interdisciplinary teams across consulting, data, and tech functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; AI solutions:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the development of data strategies, AI use cases, and business intelligence solutions, contributing to governance frameworks and implementation roadmaps where relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge sharing &amp;amp; collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to a strong team culture by sharing knowledge, staying up to date with digital and AI trends, and supporting continuous team development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business development &amp;amp; thought leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively contribute to Artefact’s growth in Germany - supporting client proposals, shaping new service offerings, and creating intellectual capital such as frameworks, point-of-views, and benchmarks that strengthen our market position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At our heart, we define ourselves by a culture of ownership, intellectual curiosity, and cooperation. &lt;strong&gt;We are looking for driven, capable talents who bring strong motivation and curiosity for new challenges.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You have at least 2–3 years of experience in management consulting, technology consulting, or in-house corporate strategy roles, with a proven track record of participating in data/AI strategy, cloud transformation, or applied AI/Machine Learning projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; A completed university degree (Bachelor’s or Master&#39;s) in Business Administration, Economics, Computer Science, Business Informatics, Physics, Mathematics, or a comparable quantitative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; You possess a strong affinity for data management and modern AI technologies. You are familiar with concepts like Generative AI, LLMs, or predictive analytics and are eager to bridge the gap between business needs and AI deployment. Ideally, you have hands-on experience in AI use case conceptualization or data platform tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business &amp;amp; analytical mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You combine strong analytical skills with a business-oriented perspective. You enjoy identifying business problems and translating them into practical AI and data-driven solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical skills:&lt;/strong&gt; You are confident working with PowerPoint and Google Slides to produce polished client-ready output. More importantly, you know how to leverage AI tools - from LLM environments to agentic workflows - to run analysis, generate insights, and accelerate delivery. Experience with SQL, BI tools, or programming languages is not a requirement, but comfort with structured data and a hands-on attitude toward new tools is expected.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; You communicate complex technical topics clearly in both German and English. You enjoy working in interdisciplinary teams and collaborating across different levels and functions (e.g., translating requirements between business stakeholders and data scientists).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal attributes:&lt;/strong&gt; You are proactive, structured, and solution-oriented, with a strong client focus and stakeholder understanding. You thrive in dynamic environments and enjoy solving complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Business-fluent German and English are required - you will participate in client workshops, present to senior stakeholders, and write deliverables in both languages. Additional languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Eligibility:&lt;/strong&gt; A valid work permit for Germany.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why ARTEFACT?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impactful client work:&lt;/strong&gt; Work on challenging projects with leading national and international clients across data, digitalisation, and advanced data strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career growth opportunities:&lt;/strong&gt; We believe in performance over tenure. Your growth is driven by your impact, not your length of service, with clear opportunities to progress and diverse career prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive rewards:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong compensation package including a performance-based bonus, which is paid out half-yearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; development:&lt;/strong&gt; Join a team of passionate Data Consultants who actively support each other. You&#39;ll learn through diverse projects, collaboration, and exposure to leading experts in the field - including international work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; time off: &lt;/strong&gt;Hybrid working model, 28 days of annual leave, plus your birthday as well as Christmas &amp;amp; New Year&#39;s Eve&amp;nbsp;off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is based in Berlin or Munich.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Don&#39;t worry if you don&#39;t meet all the criteria!&lt;/strong&gt; At Artefact, we value motivation, pragmatic problem-solving, and potential above all else.If you are excited about shaping the future of AI and ready to make a real impact, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion at Artefact&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;gt; We believe that unique perspectives fuel innovation. At Artefact, we are committed to creating an inclusive environment where everyone can thrive. We welcome and consider all applications purely based on merit, skills, and potential - regardless of gender identity, sexual orientation, race, ethnicity, religion, age, background, or disability. Come as you are!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to take the next step?&lt;/strong&gt; Please submit your CV showcasing your experience and passion for this role as a Senior Consultant (m/f/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy. We look forward to receiving your application!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-preview__description &quot; data-test-description=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you have any questions, feel free to send us a message at -----
&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who/What is Artefact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in data, digital, and analytics to help clients achieve tangible business impact. With 2,000+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 26 countries, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. At our German offices, we are on a rapid growth trajectory, advising leading national and international clients cross-industry on how to unlock the full potential of their data, build scalable data architectures, and implement cutting-edge AI solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Consulting Manager (m/f/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;, you will act as a trusted sparring partner to executives, steer complex transformation programs across functions, and drive organizational change at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead AI Transformation Programs:&lt;/strong&gt; Steer end-to-end execution of enterprise-level AI transformations. Identify internal champions, navigate corporate politics, manage structural blockers, and drive measurable user adoption and organizational change.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy &amp;amp; AI Use Case Scoping:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with C-level stakeholders to answer high-stakes questions: How can AI reshape their business models? How should they govern data? You don&#39;t just advise; you help evaluate model choices, discuss data privacy trade-offs, and conceptualize technical feasibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Business Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively drive the growth of our German practice. Take ownership in lead generation and pipeline conversion by engaging prospective clients, shaping proposals, and leading pre-sales and key-account expansion initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thought Leadership &amp;amp; Advocacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Represent Artefact&#39;s AI Transformation perspective externally. Advance our voice in enterprise AI through expert discussions, content creation (e.g. LinkedIn, whitepapers), and opinionated, hands-on perspectives on applied AI trends and real-world adoption pathways.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advance the Practice:&lt;/strong&gt; Evolve our methodologies, tools, and frameworks to keep our offering state-of-the-art. Develop reusable transformation playbooks and bring your strategic consulting or technology expertise into the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Mentoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a senior advisor and role model - leading, coaching, and mentoring agile, hybrid project teams (consultants, data scientists, and engineers), fostering a fast-paced, “can-do” culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At our heart, we define ourselves by a culture of ownership, intellectual curiosity, and cooperation. &lt;strong&gt;We are looking for driven, capable talents who bring strong motivation and curiosity for new challenges.&lt;/strong&gt; You are a true team player, eager to support others while scaling both the company and your own career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You have approximately 5–8 years of full-time working experience in top-tier management consulting, technology consulting, or strategic corporate in-house roles. A proven track record of successfully leading and delivering data, analytics, or AI-driven transformation projects is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transformation &amp;amp; Change Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience leading complex, cross-functional transformation programs, with the ability to manage executive stakeholders, navigate corporate politics, and embed AI capabilities within client organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Fluency &amp;amp; &quot;Builder Mindset&quot;:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong fluency in modern and applied AI (e.g., GenAI, LLMs, agentic systems, automated workflows). While you don&#39;t need to be a full-time programmer, you have a hands-on understanding and can credibly demo working AI concepts and discuss data privacy and technical constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Technical Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Knowledge about common machine learning techniques, cloud architectures, and data management principles. Excellent quantitative skills to draw strategic insights from complex data sets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Outstanding communication, presentation, and moderation skills. You have a strong presence and can translate complex technical topics into compelling arguments for non-technical senior executives, as well as bridge the gap to technical execution teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent academic track record with a Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Business Administration, Economics, Computer Science, Business Informatics, Physics, Mathematics, or a comparable quantitative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Business-fluency in both German and English (written and spoken) is mandatory to successfully advise our German clients and lead workshops. Additional languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Eligibility:&lt;/strong&gt; A valid work permit for Germany.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy with a Data Edge:&lt;/strong&gt; Artefact sits uniquely at the crossroads of top-tier business strategy and deep tech. You will build boardroom-level strategy expertise while staying at the absolute forefront of AI, data management, and digital value creation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact &amp;amp; Entrepreneurial Freedom:&lt;/strong&gt; As part of a fast-growing team in Germany, you will have high visibility from day one. You will directly help shape Artefact&#39;s footprint in the region, bringing in your own ideas and driving business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Learning:&lt;/strong&gt; Constant exposure to new AI solutions at the intersection of technology and business. Access to regular training in both strategy consulting methodologies and the latest AI/data capabilities through our global network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture of Doers:&lt;/strong&gt; We combine a high degree of self-assurance with a supportive, collaborative environment. We are entrepreneurial, fast-moving, and committed to delivering real impact - while strongly supporting each other&#39;s personal growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is based in Berlin or Munich.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Don&#39;t worry if you don&#39;t meet all the criteria!&lt;/strong&gt; At Artefact, we value motivation, pragmatic problem-solving, and potential above all else.If you are excited about shaping the future of AI and ready to make a real impact, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion at Artefact&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;gt; &lt;em&gt;We believe that unique perspectives fuel innovation. At Artefact, we are committed to creating an inclusive environment where everyone can thrive. We welcome and consider all applications purely based on merit, skills, and potential - regardless of gender identity, sexual orientation, race, ethnicity, religion, age, background, or disability. Come as you are!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to take the next step?&lt;/strong&gt; Please submit your CV showcasing your experience and passion for this role as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Consulting Manager (m/f/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;. We look forward to receiving your application!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you have any questions, feel free to send us a message at -----Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Superchat, we&#39;re rebuilding how businesses talk to their customers. The phone call, the contact form, the support ticket: all of it is being replaced by messaging and AI. We&#39;re building the platform that runs underneath.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2020, Superchat has become the platform of choice for &lt;strong&gt;10,000+ businesses worldwide&lt;/strong&gt;, from globally recognized brands like Allianz, Auto1, Enpal, Danone, and GASAG to the small businesses, dental practices, and one-person startups that need to look bigger than they are. Today, &lt;strong&gt;millions of messages flow through Superchat every single day&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We started as a unified inbox: one place for every channel a customer might pick, WhatsApp, email, SMS, Instagram. Then ChatGPT happened, and the second chapter began: AI agents that respond across chat, email, and voice at the quality of the best human teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re &lt;strong&gt;100 people&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;profitable&lt;/strong&gt;, and have raised &lt;strong&gt;€18M in funding&lt;/strong&gt; (last round 4.5 years ago, we&#39;ve been growing on our own money since). Headquartered in Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a backend-leaning Tech Lead to lead a team of 3-4 engineers and own the tech for a part of Superchat’s product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on leadership role: You’ll spend roughly half your time designing and building software and the other half enabling your team to perform at its best. Work directly on architecture, development and important projects while creating the clarity, feedback and environment your engineers need to deliver an excellent product&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Want&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A strong, current backend engineer.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You bring 3+ years of experience as a Senior or Staff Engineer and remain deeply involved in software development. You are comfortable owning, designing and building crucial parts of production systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experienced with the JVM ecosystem.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You have substantial experience with Java or another JVM language. Kotlin and AWS experience are a plus, since our backend runs on Kotlin/Quarkus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to lead people.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You may already have worked in a hybrid Tech Lead role, have been an Engineering manager for a short time or be taking your first steps in people leadership after successfully owning projects and architecture. What matters is that you genuiely want to help people grow&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong at delivery.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You know how to turn product goals into reality. You are used to work in fast-paced startups and are a driver to increase velocity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product-minded.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You care about solving the customers problem. You engage with product decisions, challenge assumptions constructivly and find pragmatic solutions to build things in a lean way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear communicator.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You are able to explain complex technical things in details to Engineers and in an understandable way to non-technical stakeholders. You create alignment and motivate people&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excited about AI-assisted development.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You are already using AI in your development workflow and are eager to explore how it can improve engineering speed, quality and the way teams work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Don’t Want&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure people manager.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You no longer want to work directly on software. This role requires meaningful, ongoing involvement in architecture, implementation, code review, and technical problem-solving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hero engineer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You want to make every important technical decision yourself or become the bottleneck for the team. Your job is to raise the effectiveness of the whole team, not to be the only person who can solve difficult problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure delivery manager.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You treat engineering as a ticketing operation focused only on timelines and task tracking instead of product quality, technical health, and team growth. We need engineering leaders, not project coordinators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote-only operator.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You prefer fully remote work and don’t want to actively build relationships and culture in person with the team. We believe strong engineering leadership requires regular in-person collaboration and presence in Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Day To Day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spend approximately 50% of your time contributing directly to architecture, development, code reviews, and important technical projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a team of 3-4 engineers and take responsibility for its effectiveness, technical quality, and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with your Product Manager to understand customer problems, shape solutions, scope projects, and set priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear technical direction while enabling engineers to own decisions and develop their judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run regular 1:1s, give actionable feedback, and support each engineer’s development and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove blockers, manage dependencies, and help the team identify delivery risks early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve engineering practices and explore effective uses of AI throughout the software-development lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to hiring through technical interviews, structured feedback, and candidate conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director of Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Your manager and partner on people development, calibration, processes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct Reports: &lt;/strong&gt;Engineers in your team; you own their development, performance and growth&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Manager:&lt;/strong&gt; PMs own what and why; you own how (delivery) and who (people)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CTO and CPO: &lt;/strong&gt;We are a lean organization with a flat hierarchy. You will regulary disccuss the direction of architecture with the CTO and product with the CPO&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Why People Choose Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission that matters. &lt;/strong&gt;Real impact on small businesses, not abstract metrics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Funded with conviction. &lt;/strong&gt;$18M raised and profitable&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern stack. &lt;/strong&gt;Kotlin/Quarkus, AWS, TypeScript/React/Next.js, and LangGraph for AI-powered features&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Squad-based organization. &lt;/strong&gt;Each squad owns its domain end-to-end with real ownership and autonomy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Two clear career tracks&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt; We support both individual contributor growth (up to Staff level) and Management Paths with explicit reversibility between both and Tech Lead being the first level of management that is still quite hands-on&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product-led structure. &lt;/strong&gt;PMs report directly to the CPO, keeping product strategy focused, consistent, and clearly prioritized&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid by design. &lt;/strong&gt;Our Berlin office in Prenzlauer Berg is the center of gravity, with two work-from-home days as the standard setup&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct feedback culture. &lt;/strong&gt;Honest, direct, and kind feedback is part of how we work together - in 1:1s, retrospectives, and everyday collaboration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Choose between an Urban Sports Club/John Reed membership or a public transport/Dance subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular company and team events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual personal development budget of €500 for conferences, courses, books, career coaching, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive and exciting startup culture that enables fast professional and personal growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Beautiful office in the heart of Berlin (Prenzlauer Allee 242) with free snacks, drinks, and top-notch equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want to build a community, not just a company.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It’s important to us to create an environment where people genuinely enjoy spending time together - whether that’s through HYROX training, golfing, beer pong tournaments, running clubs, Warhammer, weekend activities, or whatever kind of community you’d like to help build here!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re looking for people with passion, grit, and integrity. You&#39;re encouraged to apply even if your experience doesn&#39;t precisely match the description. At Superchat, we welcome diverse perspectives and people who think rigorously.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relocating to Berlin? We support you with practical relocation help. You&#39;ll feel home in no time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We look forward to your application! 🙂&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;With your application you agree to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/f601741cb4f24d418411aa0ff86c3787?pvs=21&quot;&gt;privacy policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.imgur.com/Uicf3C7.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;At JetBrains, code is our passion. Ever since we started, back in 2000, we have been striving to make the strongest, most effective developer tools on earth. By automating routine checks and corrections, our tools speed up production, freeing developers to grow, discover, and create.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are now looking for a Senior Legal Counsel – Employment Law, based in Germany, to provide expert legal support on German employment law and contribute to employment-related matters across JetBrains’ global operations. The role involves supporting HR in managing sensitive workplace situations, contributing to the development and implementation of employment practices that align with legal standards and business needs, and advising on employee representation structures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor to HR&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;on sensitive and complex employee matters, providing strategic guidance that takes into account legal requirements, organizational context, and reputational considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;strategic legal support and pragmatic counsel to the Group Counsel – Labor Law, General Counsel, and the HR team, with a primary focus on German labor law and broader support across JetBrains’ operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle a wide range of employee matters, including complex and sensitive cases in Germany, and assist with such matters in other jurisdictions by developing sound legal strategies, reviewing documentation, and helping the business confidently stand behind its decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess and respond to complex or nuanced internal communications and reports, supporting the development of thoughtful and well-balanced strategies aligned with legal and organizational considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft, review, and continuously improve employment agreements, contractor agreements, and HR-related templates and policies tailored to Germany and other applicable jurisdictions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct in-depth, group-wide analyses on employment and labor law topics, and lead or contribute to cross-functional projects, including the harmonization of employment policies and documentation across countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior advisor to HR teams on employment practices and workplace policies, including remote work, employee benefits, disciplinary procedures, and work safety matters, particularly for the German entities of the JetBrains group.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take a lead role in providing legal support in relation to employee representation structures with a focus on Germany.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Advise on their operations and management interactions in compliance with local legislation and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay abreast of legislative changes in German labor law and provide legal training and knowledge-sharing sessions to internal stakeholders, particularly HR and management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent JetBrains in communications with German regulatory and government bodies on employment-related matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with legal colleagues across the global team on projects and issues that intersect with employment and labor law.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in German and English, both written and spoken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A law degree with excellent academic credentials. German bar admission is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior-level post-qualification experience in employment and labor law, typically gained through 6+ years of relevant legal practice with demonstrated hands-on experience in employment dispute resolution. Experience in both in-house and reputable international law firm environments is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth knowledge of German employment law, with practical experience advising on complex workplace matters, procedures, and collaboration with employee representation structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to provide clear, solutions-oriented guidance in complex or evolving legal contexts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to assess sensitive employee-related matters, distill key issues, and develop clear, effective legal and communication approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent skills in legal drafting, negotiation, dispute resolution, and managing emotionally sensitive situations involving employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, collaborative, pragmatic, and adaptable solutions-oriented approach, with strong interpersonal skills and business awareness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to work independently in a fast-paced, international environment with multiple stakeholders and shifting priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to provide support for employment law matters in other countries with the help of external counsel and internal legal colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join JetBrains?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong base salary. We offer competitive pay that reflects your skills and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work location. Enjoy the freedom to work from home or from the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote work. Spend up to 30 days per year working remotely from abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extra time off. More days to relax, recharge, and do the things you love.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical insurance allowance. Enjoy peace of mind for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities. Access to conferences, courses, and language classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language classes. Pick up the local language or sharpen your English skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fuel your day. Enjoy a hot meal or receive a lunch allowance on workdays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health support. To help you feel your best, we provide easy access to professional mental health services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sports benefit. Enjoy an on-site gym or sports club stipend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal events. Join company-wide celebrations and team gatherings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Some benefits may vary depending on location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-MH1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace – one that welcomes everyone regardless of their background, identity, religion, age, accessibility needs, or orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We process the data provided in your job application in accordance with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/privacy/privacy-recruitment/&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, we want to change the way people eat forever by making it easier for customers around the world to discover, plan, and enjoy high-quality meals. Over the past decade, we’ve grown from a meal-kit company into a global food solutions group, active across multiple brands including HelloFresh, Factor, Green Chef, EveryPlate, Chef’s Plate, and Youfoodz.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As search behavior evolves across Google, AI Overviews, ChatGPT, Perplexity, Reddit, and other discovery surfaces, our SEO team is expanding its focus from traditional organic search to broader Organic Discovery: building the content, technical, authority, and measurement foundations that help customers find our brands wherever discovery and dinner decisions happen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Team Lead, SEO &amp;amp; GEO&lt;/strong&gt; to lead our global Organic Discovery team and help shape the next phase of how HelloFresh Group approaches organic growth. This role will lead a team of SEO/GEO specialists and work across international markets to translate global strategy into scalable programs that grow non-brand organic demand, strengthen our visibility across traditional and AI-driven search, and improve the quality and discoverability of our content.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly cross-functional leadership role. You will partner closely with Product, Engineering, Analytics, Content, Brand, and local Marketing teams to identify opportunities, prioritize the highest-impact work, and build scalable solutions across brands and markets. You’ll need to be equally comfortable setting strategy, coaching a team, digging into performance data, and influencing senior stakeholders to move complex initiatives forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and develop a team of SEO/GEO specialists, setting clear priorities and creating an environment of strong ownership, collaboration, and continuous development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define and execute the global SEO &amp;amp; GEO strategy across HelloFresh Group brands and markets, translating broader Organic Discovery priorities into actionable roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to grow non-brand organic demand and customer acquisition across traditional search engines, AI search experiences, and emerging discovery platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with local Marketing teams to understand market-specific opportunities and challenges while building global strategies, standards, and solutions that can scale across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional Organic Discovery initiatives spanning technical SEO, content strategy, on-page optimization, structured data, internal linking, authority and trust signals, and GEO/AI visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product and Engineering to translate SEO/GEO opportunities into clear requirements, influence roadmap prioritization, and ensure Organic Discovery is considered in all major product and platform decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop scalable approaches to content creation, optimization, and governance across recipe, editorial, transactional, and other high-value organic surfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advance our GEO strategy by identifying how our brands can become more visible, cited, and authoritative across AI-powered discovery experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use search, analytics, AI visibility, competitive, and internal business data to identify opportunities, diagnose performance changes, prioritize investments, and measure impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear performance reporting and communicate SEO/GEO performance, opportunities, risks, and recommendations to senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support global and local teams with SEO/GEO expertise, creating frameworks and best practices that enable markets to move quickly without sacrificing quality or consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage relationships with relevant agencies, technology partners, and vendors where appropriate, ensuring external resources are aligned to our strategy and delivering measurable value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of changes in search behavior, search engine platforms, generative AI, and the broader discovery ecosystem, translating emerging trends into practical implications for HelloFresh Group.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in SEO / Organic Growth, ideally within large-scale, international, consumer-facing websites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience leading and developing SEO or Organic Growth teams, with the ability to balance people leadership with hands-on strategic involvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Broad SEO expertise spanning technical SEO, content strategy, on-page optimization, authority, international SEO, and performance measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of how AI-powered search and answer engines are changing organic discovery, with curiosity and practical experience applying GEO/AEO principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing strategies and roadmaps across multiple markets, brands, or business units and balancing global scalability with local-market needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to partner with Product and Engineering teams, translate organic growth opportunities into clear requirements, and influence prioritization without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and experience using platforms such as Google Search Console, GA4, Ahrefs, Profound, Screaming Frog, or similar SEO, analytics, and AI-visibility tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to connect SEO/GEO performance to broader business outcomes and clearly communicate priorities, tradeoffs, and recommendations to senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and communication skills, with experience navigating complex, cross-functional organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High ownership, strong judgment, and comfort operating in an evolving environment where priorities, technologies, and customer discovery behaviors are changing quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access, and wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill. HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh is going AI-first. Join us in leading the shift and shaping the global customer experience. As a Senior UX Strategist &amp;amp; Researcher on our UX team, you&#39;ll own work from ambiguous brief to strategic outcome and implementation — defining project needs, using innovative research approaches, prototyping direction instead of presenting findings, and walking into executive meetings with a decision artifact, not a summary. The most valued teammates today aren&#39;t the ones who run the most studies. They shape which questions get asked, challenge business assumptions before money is spent, and stay in the room to drive the decision.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll use AI fluently as a genuine creative and strategic partner throughout the product design lifecycle. Strategy and research are your deepest strengths, but you’ll also work across the wider UX practice. We’re looking for people who go deep in one area and can take interface design, service design, and content to a solid minimum quality standard on their own, using AI to move fast, and who know when a problem needs a specialist’s depth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead strategic research for insights to action: &lt;/strong&gt;Own the end-to-end research and strategy work streams, from scoping through execution to insight delivery and application, balancing primary, secondary, qualitative and quantitative methods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape experiences across the ecosystem: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with product, design, marketing, operations, and business teams to understand and shape experiences across the full customer and service ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the agenda, not just respond to it: &lt;/strong&gt;Proactively identify which bets need de-risking before anyone has asked. Challenge briefs before executing them. Connect findings to business decisions, market context, and KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence at strategic altitude:&lt;/strong&gt; influence decision-makers— often VP/SVP — presenting in formats that force a decision in the room, not a follow-up meeting. Build visual directions, opportunity frameworks, and concept artifacts that make choices tangible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and lead workshops:&lt;/strong&gt; Own co-creation and alignment sessions end-to-end — the room, the agenda, and the output. Move teams from findings to direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make insight visible:&lt;/strong&gt; Build prototypes, concept visualizations, and service scenarios — using AI where needed to close the gap between insight and expression.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply the right method for the moment:&lt;/strong&gt; Select methods based on what the problem demands, not what&#39;s most familiar. Apply foundational, generative, or evaluative methodologies, rightsized to the context and the level of speed and rigor required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work AI-native across strategy and research: &lt;/strong&gt;Apply AI from framing the problem and scoping studies through analysis, synthesis, and strategic recommendations. Use it to prototype directions and create decision-informed content, turning findings into executive-ready narratives and visual frameworks that compress the insight-to-action cycle. Experiment with novel methods, bring what works into live projects, and apply critical judgment throughout, knowing when to override the model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Break down barriers across UX: &lt;/strong&gt;Use AI to flex into interface design, service design, and content, producing work that meets a clear minimum quality bar on your own, and knowing when a problem needs a specialist’s depth. Help the team do the same by sharing what works, so AI removes execution barriers between disciplines and scales across the UX organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in UX research, UX strategy, Service Design or a closely related field within a product or tech environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mixed-methods toolkit with strong judgment for when to apply which approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience influencing VP/SVP-level stakeholders — changing decisions, not just informing them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to design and lead workshops and co-creation sessions with cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prototype and visualize strategic direction independently — through concept sketches, lo-fi prototypes, service blueprints, or AI-assisted artifacts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong strategic storytelling and visual communication; deliverables built to move people, not just inform them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine AI native workflows and outputs in a research or strategy context — demonstrated point of view on how AI should change our workflows and where its limits are, as well as practical experience applying AI in real project contexts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business acumen: able to connect research to trade-offs, market context, and commercial implications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Depth plus breadth: Deep strategy and research skills, plus working knowledge of interface design, service design, and content craft. You can produce work that meets a defined quality bar with AI support, and you’re comfortable handing off when the depth required goes beyond that.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with a German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#UX #DESIGN #RESEARCH&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The (Senior) Category Manager Marketing will be responsible for overseeing strategic sourcing and contracting at HelloFresh for Marketing across different marketing categories, which may include: Offline Media, Online Media, Influencer Marketing, Sponsorships, Retail Media, etc. The goal is to collaborate seamlessly with Global and regional stakeholders and major suppliers in all HelloFresh markets and help them to navigate the procurement landscape. In addition, the role will be supporting initiatives targeted to increase the maturity level of Indirect Procurement’s processes and systems landscape. As part of the Marketing&amp;nbsp; Procurement team the position will report to the respective lead based in Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an entrepreneurial, confident, proactive and high-spirited Procurement professional with a strength for prioritisation, data handling and great stakeholder management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end Marketing sourcing: supplier market mapping, RFx execution, negotiation, and contract award for high-value projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop category strategies for different marketing categories, in alignment with the business’ goals&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create, align and execute a sourcing roadmap with key stakeholders in the HQ and the regional markets to deliver P&amp;amp;L savings and overall procurement value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and optimize the supplier portfolio across Hello Fresh’s markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate and manage close relationships with (senior) business partners within Marketing to support their objectives and the company growth agenda&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the implementation of best-in-class procurement processes and tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 5+ years experience in Marketing procurement or in Marketing with a commercial focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of strategic sourcing methodology, category management, and supplier management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical skills, attention to detail, and drive to working independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of taking ownership: identifying problems early and driving resolution independently, without waiting to be directed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, including preparing and delivering presentations and reports for senior audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal skills with proven ability to build trust and credibility with business partners at different levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work in a fast-moving entrepreneurial environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent Business English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, our mission is simple: to change the way people eat, forever. As the Category Manager for Packaging, you will report directly to the Director of Packaging and take full ownership of creating and developing our Primary packaging category (ingredient packaging, plastic film…). You will be responsible for developing and executing sourcing strategies to improve our cost structure, the quality of our products, and the reliability of our supply chain, while playing a leading role in supporting innovation and new product development.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an ambitious, confident, and entrepreneurial procurement professional who can balance the analytical requirements of the role with the collaborative skills needed to elevate our customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: Source primary suppliers that can co-create and develop best-in-class primary packaging solutions tailored specifically to our unique business model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Execution&lt;/strong&gt;: Leverage large internal datasets and industry benchmarks (including market, supplier, and SKU analysis) to identify opportunities for cost reduction and implement best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop the Supply Base&lt;/strong&gt;: Build and maintain a strong pool of primary packaging suppliers capable of providing all of our ingredient packaging requirements, taking full ownership of vendor selection, specs definition, KPIs and relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elevate Customer Experience&lt;/strong&gt;: Work closely with the packaging design team to improve the overall look and feel of our ingredient packaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferably deep knowledge and interest in food, Ideally working within a similar environment and sector&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Masters degree in Supply Chain / Procurement / Business (or equivalent)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of strategic procurement / supply chain / consulting experience in operations practise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of entrepreneurial mindset, and ability to prioritize workload in a fast-paced environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quantitative and analytical experience, including solid comfort with the Gsuite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, flexible, ambitious, and assertive: you take ownership of your work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TRAVEL REQUIREMENTS: &lt;/strong&gt;10% - 25% (Flexible)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the &lt;strong&gt;Director, Paid Search (maternity leave cover)&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be responsible for moving HelloFresh Group&#39;s paid search stack into the next autonomous era. You will lead our largest multi-MM$ performance digital channel across our global portfolio, with strategic focus on three platforms: &lt;strong&gt;Google, Bing, and OpenAI&lt;/strong&gt;. You will lead a team of Search experts and architect a future-proof search infrastructure whilst scaling cost-effective customer acquisition campaigns across these channels. Reporting to the Senior Director, Performance Marketing, you will develop and execute strategic plans, use analytics to inform decisions, and drive execution to optimize marketing budgets against company profitability goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact role with the opportunity to work with teams across the organisation, from Pricing &amp;amp; Discounts, MarTech and Analytics. From the start, we would like you to focus on transforming our search stack to be competitive for years to come, identifying and driving strategic investments across Google, Bing, and OpenAI, working with our in-house experts and dedicated technical/account management teams to formulate Joint Business/technical Plans and build the infrastructure that will drive HelloFresh&#39;s paid search future.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the global paid search team and develop them into a true &#39;centre of excellence&#39; for Search internationally, including expertise in next-generation platform capabilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transform and architect the search stack: Design and build a modern, scalable, future-proof paid search infrastructure across Google, Bing, and OpenAI that positions HelloFresh for sustained competitive advantage&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct comprehensive audits to bring our Search account setup to industry &#39;best in class&#39; standards across all three platforms, identifying gaps and modernisation opportunities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the paid search strategy strategy, set and drive the strategic direction across search channels, supporting the move into the next autonomous era&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage global budget allocation: Set and dynamically reallocate budget across markets, brands, and channels to hit volume growth and CPA/CAC targets, forecasting and reporting with rigour.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead senior agency and platform relationships: Act as the strategic lead and escalation point for external agencies and platform partners (including Google, DSPs, and mobile platforms), setting the agenda on plans, investment, and innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Marketing Analytics to execute tests across search portfolios to measure incrementality and marginal efficiency and consequently optimise in-house systems and algorithms to profitably scale our Search marketing programmes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a close partner to MarTech teams to bring the search staack into the next stage of automation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor&#39;s degree with a strong academic record and/or proven relevant experience in a performance marketing or highly commercial role within D2C or subscription-based businesses&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years experience in Google Advertising ecosystem, either from an agency or client-side role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forward-thinking about how platform evolution and automation are reshaping paid search strategy, you understand both traditional optimisation and next-gen platform capabilities, and you see transformation as both challenge and opportunity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Early experience or exposure to OpenAI&#39;s Search offering or emerging AI-driven search platforms&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years experience in team management and leadership roles&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience building and embedding incrementality-based measurement frameworks (e.g. geo-testing, regression, multi-touch attribution) and partnering with Analytics on marketing mix modelling (MMM) and advanced measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert knowledge of Google bidding, targeting, and optimisation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing campaigns in all Google campaign types: Keyword Search, PMAX, Shopping, etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with performance marketing metrics and platform reporting&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Media-Mix-Models, Multi-Touch/Data-Driven Attributions, or other advanced marketing measurement methodologies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisational skills and project management ability&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry certifications on Google and Bing Ads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An entrepreneurial mindset: you embrace ownership, make bold, data-driven decisions, and relentlessly pursue innovative solutions to drive sustainable growth. Comfortable navigating ambiguity, testing new approaches, and learning from both successes and failures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the future of food:&lt;/strong&gt; Play a key role in transforming how millions of people eat as we grow into a global food solutions company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive transformational change:&lt;/strong&gt; Your decisions will have a direct and immediate impact, helping to shape strategy, scale teams, and redefine leadership in a rapidly evolving business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build a global brand:&lt;/strong&gt; Create deeper, more sustainable connections with our customers, putting them at the heart of every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thrive in a high-performance environment:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with ambitious, intellectually curious peers on a global scale, enjoying an environment built for empowerment and speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enjoy &lt;/strong&gt;savings on your weekly HelloFresh box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Save &lt;/strong&gt;with discount schemes and corporate benefits via Vorteile.net&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support &lt;/strong&gt;your mental wellbeing with access to platforms like Headspace and Spill.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay &lt;/strong&gt;active with 24/7 office gym access, a discounted Urban Sports Club membership, and other wellbeing resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embrace &lt;/strong&gt;&quot;Learning Never Stops&quot; with internal training, the HelloFresh Academy, and a dedicated budget for German language courses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Stark, we forge the future of European and national security through cutting-edge, AI-driven technology and unmatched engineering precision. As a premier defence technology company, our mission is clear: to equip NATO Allies and their partners &amp;nbsp;with next-generation autonomous defence platforms and advanced AI-driven software built to perform in the world’s most demanding environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe that true security stems from relentless innovation. By combining elite engineering talent with agile technology and an AI-native operational culture, Stark turns complex defence challenges into field-tested, multi-domain solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;WHY JOIN US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The software and systems you work on directly protect personnel and defend European and national sovereignty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will work alongside industry-leading minds on autonomous systems, advanced propulsion, and secure cyber platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a fast-paced, collaborative environment where bold ideas are supported by serious R&amp;amp;D backing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will join our Finance &amp;amp; Accounting team based in Berlin, playing a pivotal role in ensuring financial integrity, compliance, and strategic financial operations. Working closely with cross-functional teams and senior leadership, you will contribute directly to supporting Stark&#39;s hyper-growth and mission-critical defense technology initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;As a Senior Accountant, you will oversee end-to-end accounting operations, statutory reporting, and financial compliance across our operations. You will drive process improvements, maintain precise financial records, and provide key financial insights to empower data-driven strategic decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO AT STARK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Manage and execute month-end, quarter-end, and year-end closing activities in accordance with HGB and IFRS standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Prepare financial statements, tax filings, and regulatory compliance reports accurately and on schedule.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Oversee general ledger accounting, accounts payable/receivable, and bank reconciliations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Lead internal and external audit coordination, acting as the primary point of contact for auditors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Optimize internal controls, accounting workflows, and financial systems to support scalable company growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Financial Planning &amp;amp; Analysis (FP&amp;amp;A) to align accounting outputs with budgeting and forecasting models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING TO THE MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;5+ years of relevant experience in accounting or auditing, preferably within a fast-growing tech or manufacturing environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong expertise in HGB accounting principles; thorough familiarity with IFRS is highly desirable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Accounting, Finance, Business Administration, or a related field (CPA/Steuerberater qualification is a plus).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Proficiency with modern ERP systems (e.g., DATEV, SAP, NetSuite) and advanced Excel financial modeling skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Fluent professional proficiency in both English and German.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Prior exposure to defense, aerospace, or industrial technology sectors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience handling government grants, public funding, or defense procurement regulations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with automated accounting workflows and digitized invoice processing tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re interested in building the future of European Defence with us, and you see yourself reflected on the description above, please send us your &lt;strong&gt;CV in English&lt;/strong&gt;. We&#39;re looking forward to meeting you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SECURITY CLEARANCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Due to the nature of our work in the defence sector, candidates must be eligible to obtain and maintain the appropriate security clearance required for this position. Details will be provided during the recruitment process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive workplace. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, colour, religion, sex, national origin, disability, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DATA PRIVACY STATEMENT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This data privacy statement, which refers exclusively to data collected as part of the online application process, is to inform you about how your personal data that is collected as part of the online application process is handled at our end.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The controller&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The controller under data protection law is:&lt;/p&gt;
