&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience integrating RF systems onto airborne, vehicle-mounted, maritime, fixed-site or dismounted platforms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Understanding of antenna selection, placement, radiation patterns, platform effects and co-site interference&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience with wideband receivers, transmit chains, power amplifiers, low-noise amplifiers, filters and RF switching networks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience conducting electromagnetic compatibility, electromagnetic environmental effects and radio-frequency interference assessments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
