&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 class=&quot;section-header section-header--large font-primary&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;About Digital Asset &amp;amp; the Canton Network&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Digital Asset builds the technologies that are reshaping the foundations of financial markets. Our mission is to create the world’s most trusted, privacy-enabled, and interoperable digital infrastructure for global finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the heart of this mission is the Canton Network - the blockchain purpose-built for institutional finance. Uniquely combining privacy, compliance, and scalability, Canton enables real-time, secure settlement across multiple asset classes. Governed by the Canton Foundation with participation from leading financial institutions, it is the proven link between the promise of blockchain and the power of global finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2014 and headquartered in New York City, with offices in London, Zurich, Budapest, Hong Kong, and Sydney— we are on a mission to transform finance— and that transformation is now playing out rapidly on the Canton Network.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you’re interested in playing a crucial role at the intersection of traditional and crypto-capital markets and want to help bring the next trillion dollars of finance on-chain, join us.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;isPasted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Canton Network is delivering what others promised but couldn’t: a blockchain for finance that actually works. As the only open layer 1 blockchain network with configurable privacy and controls sufficient for regulatory compliance, it is the venue where DeFi and TradFi are converging.&lt;/p&gt;
We are looking for a visionary Principal Product Manager to lead our Stablecoins &amp;amp; Onchain Payments product activation program. This is not just a &quot;feature-owner&quot; role, but rather you will be the architect of how stablecoins &amp;amp; payments move across the Canton Network.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As TradFi and DeFi converge, the demand for stable, regulatory-compliant and programmable units of value has never been higher. You will define and own the strategy for Digital Asset stablecoin &amp;amp; payments activation on the network, ensuring that stablecoin implementations and payment rails are not only technically superior but commercially dominant in contrast to other networks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and validate sustainable stablecoin and payment use cases on the Canton network, that can be activated together with institutional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute the strategy and roadmap for stablecoins (fiat-backed, RWA-backed) and payments activation on the Canton Network, involving a cross-functional team of stakeholders and network participants (e.g. Tier 1 Stablecoin &amp;amp; RWA asset issuers).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with institutional partners to design workflows that connect legacy payment &amp;amp; PoS systems with Canton’s privacy-enabled ledger.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Legal and Compliance teams to ensure payment initiatives meet global standards (e.g. MiCA, Basel III) while maintaining the privacy benefits of the Canton Network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that the scaling of stablecoin and payment use cases focuses on high-availability, security and low-latency settlement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track Key Value Indicators (KVIs) for the use case activation on the network such as Mint/Burn volumes and Transaction Volume/Numbers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary product subject matter expert for stablecoins and payments use cases and activation within Digital Asset.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of Product Management experience, with at least 3 years focused on stablecoins and payments .&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of shipping products related to stablecoins use case intersecting with aspects of treasury management, cross-border payments, PoS provision or automated clearing houses (ACH)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the stablecoin and payments stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of blockchain technology &amp;nbsp;is required and it would be great to have a familiarity with payments focussed layer 1/2 ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;While not a developer, you can confidently discuss application architecture, smart contract logic, and settlement workflows with engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building for B2B or B2B2C environments where security, compliance and &quot;five-nines&quot; reliability are non-negotiable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable discussing business models, pricing strategies and tokenomics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BIG BONUS: Direct experience with the Canton Network, Daml, or building institutional-grade Stablecoin payment applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are a hybrid workplace company, so you need to be willing to work at least 3 days per week from one of our offices (New York, Zürich, London or Budapest).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The range below may vary if based outside the New York tri-state area (New York, New Jersey, and Connecticut). Base salaries are determined during our interview process, during which we assess the candidate&#39;s experience, skills, and capabilities against internal peers and the scope and responsibilities of the position.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Pay Transparency&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$200,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$250,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Digital Asset, we are committed to compensation structures that reward impact consistently across our global teams. We support our people at every stage of life with comprehensive, family-forward benefits and flexible working models designed to help you do your best work.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; We offer a comprehensive benefits package designed to support the well-being of our team members. Health and insurance benefits vary by region to ensure local relevance and compliance, and may include medical, dental, and vision coverage.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Digital Asset is an equal opportunity employer committed. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, national origin, sex, religion, sexual orientation, age, disability, citizenship status, veteran status, or any other basis protected by applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Eligibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; If and as required by applicable law, all persons hired to work at Digital Asset will be required to verify identity and eligibility to work in the location for which they have an offer to work and to complete the necessary employment eligibility verification documents upon hire.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ccommodations&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Applicants with disabilities who require accommodation during the application or interview process should contact &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;California Privacy Act (CCPA)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; If you are based in California, we encourage you to read this important information for California residents linked &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.digitalasset.com/ccpacpranotice&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1&quot;&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About VML Live&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At &lt;strong&gt;VML Live&lt;/strong&gt;, we believe brands don’t just belong in ad breaks—they belong in culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We exist to create moments that matter in the real world. By uniting brand ambition with genuine fan passion, we turn sponsorships and commercial rights into living, breathing cultural phenomena. Whether it’s global sports tournaments, music festivals, gaming universes, or grassroots movements, we ensure our clients show up where audiences are genuinely invested.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A brand’s partnership rights are only as powerful as the way they are activated. Too many sponsorships end at logo placement; at VML Live, that’s where our work begins.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Strategist (Sport &amp;amp; Entertainment)&lt;/strong&gt;, you will sit at the vital intersection of &lt;strong&gt;brand strategy, commercial rights, and multi-channel comms planning&lt;/strong&gt;. Your mission is to take partnership assets—new or legacy—and translate them into culturally resonant, high-impact activation strategies that excite fans and move the commercial needle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own strategic relationships across flagship accounts, guide creative teams with inspiring, actionable briefs, and spearhead pitches that showcase VML Live’s specialist edge to prospective clients across the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect End-to-End Activation Plans:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate brand ambitions, fan insights, and complex rights packages into integrated, channel-ready activation frameworks spanning experiential, digital, social, PR, content, and paid media.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unlock Value Beyond Visibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure every asset, contractual right, and IP opportunity is leveraged creatively and commercially—moving clients from passive sponsor to active cultural participant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the Strategic Catalyst for Creative:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with creative teams, providing sharp, fertile briefs and frameworks that empower them to develop bold work with speed, focus, and clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Pitches &amp;amp; Drive Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Play a pivotal role in new business and competitive pitches, crafting compelling narratives that demonstrate how partnership activation drives measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate Across the Network:&lt;/strong&gt; Champion integrated thinking by seamlessly connecting with teams across VML Live, broader VML, and WPP sister agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prove What Works:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with data and effectiveness teams to build robust measurement frameworks, proving ROI and turning campaign learnings into future strategic advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Cultural &amp;amp; Fan native:&lt;/strong&gt; You understand fandom, subcultures, and audience behaviors in sport, music, gaming, or entertainment, and know how brands can show up authentically without gatecrashing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An Integrated Strategist:&lt;/strong&gt; You have proven experience bridging brand strategy, partnership activation, and comms/channel planning within an agency, rights holder, or brand environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Master Storyteller:&lt;/strong&gt; You know how to structure an argument, articulate a vision, and deliver presentations that captivate senior clients and win high-stakes pitches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercially &amp;amp; Operationally Astute:&lt;/strong&gt; You understand rights contracts, sponsorship mechanics, and production realities—ensuring your strategic visions are both ambitious and executable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Collaborative Leader:&lt;/strong&gt; You thrive in fast-paced, multi-disciplinary environments and enjoy mentoring junior team members while holding your own with senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why VML Live?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unrivalled Scale &amp;amp; Access:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with some of the world’s most recognizable brands, governing bodies, and entertainment properties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connected Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Join a collaborative, forward-thinking team backed by the global reach, tools, and intelligence of the VML and WPP network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real Cultural Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; See your ideas come to life in stadiums, arenas, digital spaces, and on the streets—shaping how fans experience the things they love most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; We offer competitive compensation, comprehensive benefits, flexible hybrid working policies, and dedicated career development pathways.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1&quot;&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Senior CX Strategist&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company:&lt;/strong&gt; VML UK&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London – Sea Containers House, SE1&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Model:&lt;/strong&gt; Hybrid&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to:&lt;/strong&gt; Head of Planning&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who We Are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At VML, we are a global creative company that brings together brand experience, customer experience and commerce to create connected brands and drive growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We combine creativity, strategy, data and technology to help some of the world&#39;s biggest brands build meaningful relationships with their customers. From shaping brand experiences to designing connected customer journeys, we believe the best work happens when different perspectives and capabilities come together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re now looking for a Senior CX Strategist to join our London strategy team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most brands don&#39;t have a communications problem. They have an experience problem. A gap between what they promise and what customers actually experience at the moments that matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior CX Strategist who can help close that gap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Someone who understands that great customer experience isn&#39;t just about individual touchpoints, CRM campaigns or digital journeys. It&#39;s about connecting the entire customer experience, from the first interaction with a brand through to building long-term relationships, loyalty and advocacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll bring together &lt;strong&gt;CX, CRM and brand-level thinking&lt;/strong&gt;, using customer insight, creativity and data to develop strategies that make experiences better for customers and more effective for businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work across a range of exciting clients, including major global brands, helping them understand their customers, identify opportunities and create more connected, meaningful experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role for someone who enjoys getting under the skin of a business challenge, asking the right questions and turning complex customer problems into clear, inspiring strategic thinking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be comfortable working with creative teams, collaborating with data and experience specialists, and presenting your thinking to clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, you&#39;ll be someone who sees the bigger picture but isn&#39;t afraid to get into the detail.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Connecting Brand, CX and CRM&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop integrated customer experience strategies that connect brand ambition with real customer needs and behaviours.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Look across the entire customer journey, identifying opportunities to create more seamless, engaging and valuable experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bring together brand strategy, CRM, digital experiences and customer engagement to create joined-up strategic thinking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understand how different channels and touchpoints work together, from brand communications and social to digital, commerce, CRM and physical experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help clients move beyond individual campaigns and channels to think about the wider customer relationship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Turning Insight into Strategy&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use customer research, behavioural insights, data and market understanding to uncover meaningful opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Map customer journeys, identify pain points and understand the moments that matter most.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Translate complex business and customer challenges into clear strategic recommendations and compelling creative briefs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop customer propositions, experience principles and strategic frameworks that inspire creative and experience design teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Challenge existing thinking and bring fresh perspectives to how brands engage with their customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Making Customer Experience More Effective&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work closely with data and analytics teams to understand customer behaviour and identify opportunities for growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop strategies that improve customer acquisition, engagement, retention, loyalty and lifetime value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understand how to measure the effectiveness of customer experiences and connect customer outcomes to business performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help define meaningful KPIs and measurement frameworks that demonstrate the impact of strategic recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use performance insights to identify what&#39;s working, what isn&#39;t and where experiences can be improved.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bringing Strategy to Life&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with Creative, Experience Design, Data, Technology and Client Services teams to turn strategic thinking into meaningful customer experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Write clear, inspiring briefs that give creative teams a strong foundation to develop ideas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contribute strategic thinking throughout the creative development process, ensuring ideas remain grounded in customer insight and business objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help connect strategic ambition with practical execution across different channels and customer touchpoints.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bring curiosity, fresh thinking and a willingness to challenge the expected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Building Strong Client Relationships&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build trusted relationships with clients, becoming someone they turn to for thoughtful, informed strategic advice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Present recommendations clearly and confidently, making complex thinking easy to understand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work alongside senior strategists and wider teams to identify opportunities to develop existing client relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contribute to pitches, proactive ideas and new business opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support and mentor more junior team members, sharing knowledge and helping strengthen the wider strategy team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who combines strategic thinking with genuine curiosity about people, brands and the experiences that connect them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don&#39;t need to have worked across every aspect of CX, but you should have a strong understanding of how customer experience, CRM and brand strategy come together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideally, you&#39;ll bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Solid experience in CX, CRM, customer engagement or integrated strategy, gained within an agency, consultancy or client-side environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A strong understanding of end-to-end customer journeys, including acquisition, conversion, onboarding, engagement, retention and loyalty.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ability to connect customer experience thinking with wider brand strategy and business objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience developing customer-centric strategies, journey maps, propositions and creative briefs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Confidence working with customer data, research and behavioural insights to inform strategic recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An understanding of how customer experience can drive measurable business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working across multiple channels and touchpoints, including digital, CRM, content, social and physical experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong communication and storytelling skills, with the ability to present strategic thinking to clients and internal teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A collaborative approach and the ability to work closely with creative, data, technology and experience specialists.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A genuine interest in how customer behaviours, technology and emerging trends are changing the way people interact with brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It would also be great if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working with automotive, FMCG or other major consumer brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An understanding of retail, dealership or complex customer journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience contributing to pitches or identifying opportunities for client growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An interest in AI and emerging technologies and how they can improve customer experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The Kind of Person You&#39;ll Be&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious about people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re genuinely interested in understanding what makes people tick. You ask questions, challenge assumptions and look beyond the obvious to uncover what customers really need.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative in your thinking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You believe strategy should inspire great work, not just explain a problem. You can turn insight into ideas and enjoy collaborating with creative teams to bring those ideas to life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable with complexity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can see the bigger picture while understanding the detail. You&#39;re able to connect different parts of a customer journey and turn complicated challenges into clear, actionable thinking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercially minded&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You understand that great customer experiences need to deliver value for both customers and businesses. You&#39;re interested in effectiveness and can connect strategic recommendations to meaningful outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative and confident&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You enjoy working with different disciplines, sharing ideas and learning from others. You&#39;re confident expressing a point of view, but equally open to being challenged.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s in It for You?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The opportunity to work with some of the world&#39;s most recognised brands on meaningful customer experience challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A genuinely integrated environment where CX, brand strategy, creativity, data, commerce and technology come together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The chance to shape experiences across the entire customer journey rather than being limited to a single channel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A collaborative and supportive strategy team where your ideas and perspective will be valued.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Opportunities to develop your strategic craft, broaden your experience and progress your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hybrid working from our London office at Sea Containers House.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A competitive salary and access to VML and WPP benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Commitment to Inclusion and Belonging&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At VML, we believe that diverse perspectives, experiences and backgrounds make us stronger and help us create better work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re committed to building an inclusive environment where everyone feels valued, supported and able to thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from people of all backgrounds, and if you need any adjustments or support during the recruitment process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Interested?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re a strategist who loves understanding people, connecting the dots between brands and customer experiences, and creating work that makes a real difference, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Come and help us shape experiences that are as creatively ambitious as they are commercially effective.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1&quot;&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Senior Strategist, Commercial Strategy&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;VML Health | London&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Strategist, Commercial Strategy&lt;/strong&gt; to join VML Health’s Global Strategy Team in London.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity for someone with a strong foundation in healthcare strategy, consulting, pharma, biotech or medical communications who enjoys getting underneath complex healthcare challenges and turning scientific, clinical and market insight into clear strategic direction.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with global healthcare clients across a range of commercial strategy challenges, helping them understand their market, differentiate their assets and prepare for successful commercialisation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead workstreams across &lt;strong&gt;commercial strategy engagements&lt;/strong&gt;, taking ownership from research through to client-ready recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore &lt;strong&gt;unmet need, market dynamics and competitive landscapes&lt;/strong&gt; to identify the insights that matter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex scientific, clinical and market information into &lt;strong&gt;clear strategic implications and compelling stories&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and co-lead primary research, including &lt;strong&gt;interviews, advisory boards and workshops&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to work spanning &lt;strong&gt;scientific narrative and value architecture, evidence and differentiation, and market readiness&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong client relationships and collaborate with colleagues across Commercial Strategy and the wider Global Strategy Team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support new business pitches and help identify opportunities to grow existing client relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide and support more junior team members across research and project delivery.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Around &lt;strong&gt;3–5 years&#39; experience&lt;/strong&gt; in healthcare strategy/consulting, pharma/biotech, medical communications, clinical research or a related scientific environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and research skills, with the ability to turn complexity into &lt;strong&gt;clear, actionable recommendations&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of healthcare commercialisation, including areas such as &lt;strong&gt;competitive landscape, positioning, differentiation, evidence needs and stakeholder decision-making&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within multi-stakeholder healthcare environments, which could include clinicians, patients, payers, advocates or policymakers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence developing high-quality presentations and communicating strategic thinking clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting primary research such as interviews, workshops or advisory boards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisation, attention to detail and the ability to take ownership of workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, curious and proactive approach.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About VML Health&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML Health is a global healthcare agency with a vision to make the world of health human-first. With global healthcare hubs in &lt;strong&gt;London, New York and Milan&lt;/strong&gt;, we bring together strategy, science, creativity and engagement to help solve complex healthcare challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join our &lt;strong&gt;Commercial Strategy team within the European Hub&lt;/strong&gt;, working as part of an integrated Global Strategy Team spanning Medical, Engagement, Brand and Commercial Strategy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What&#39;s in it for you?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aside from a generous annual leave allowance and pension allowances, you will have access to a whole host of other benefits and activities such as&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Permanent Health Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BUPA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible hybrid-working schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced family friendly policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Well-being Programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to Work Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eye Care and Glasses Vouchers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Season Ticket Loans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;WPP Discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;When you join Exclaimer you will join a global award-winning SaaS provider with an exceptional revenue rate, ambitious growth plans, and an inclusive and outcomes-driven culture.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exclaimer is a high-growth SaaS company with 300+ colleagues across the UK, US, Europe, and Asia-Pacific. We promote a people-first culture built on fairness, inclusion, psychological safety, and continuous learning. As we evolve into a multi-channel platform for branded business communications, we offer employees the opportunity to shape the future of global communication—while growing their careers in a culture where curiosity, creativity, and accountability thrive. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;We’re officially Great Place To Work Certified™&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exclaimer has been recognised by Great Place To Work® for our culture of collaboration, trust, and growth. This certification reflects our commitment to creating an environment where every voice matters and people genuinely enjoy coming to work.&amp;nbsp; See our accreditations to learn more: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greatplacetowork.co.uk/certified-company/1575695&quot;&gt;Great Place to Work® UK &lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greatplacetowork.com/certified-company/104575695&quot;&gt;| Great Place To Work® USA&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the opportunity 👇&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will be the in-house design lead for Exclaimer&#39;s marketing team, setting the standard for how our brand looks and feels wherever customers and prospects meet it. This is a hands-on role covering campaign creative, paid ads, web and landing page design, events, and motion, working closely with the brand, content, demand generation, and product marketing teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll also own quality. Our creative now comes from several places: in-house templates, AI-assisted production, freelancers, and agencies. You&#39;ll decide what you design yourself, what can be built from templates or with AI tools, and what goes to an agency, then review the output so everything we publish is consistent and on-brand.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Speed matters too. Our core web pages need redesigning for answer engine optimization (AEO), and our partner and account-based marketing (ABM) programs are growing. You will help us move faster by building reusable, easy-to-use design systems and by using AI design tools with a designer&#39;s eye for quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Brand Consistency &amp;amp; Quality Control&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own the Exclaimer visual identity, keeping the brand system, templates, and guidelines current and easy to use&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Review creative from across the team, freelancers, agencies, and AI tools, and give clear, constructive feedback so everything we publish meets brand standards&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Together with the Brand team, decide which requests you design yourself and which are delegated to agencies or produced from templates or with AI, based on audience, visibility, and shelf life&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Build reusable, well-documented templates in Figma and/or Canva that colleagues can edit by hand or use with AI tools such as Claude&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Brief, direct, and review work from external design partners, and make handovers simple&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Campaign &amp;amp; Paid Creative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Design full campaign asset sets so every touchpoint is consistent, including social ads, web banners, display ads, email and email signature banners, landing page graphics, and infographics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Create conversion-focused ads for LinkedIn and other paid channels, working to each platform&#39;s specs and producing variations for testing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Turn product imagery and UI into polished digital assets for paid, web, and sales enablement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Tailor assets for partner and ABM programs, understanding the nuances between audiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work with demand generation to use performance data to improve ad creative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Web &amp;amp; Landing Pages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Design page layouts, outlines, and imagery for landing pages and core website pages, applying UX best practice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work with the web, content, and SEO teams to speed up the redesign of core pages for AEO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Hand off Figma designs clearly to developers and web agencies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Events &amp;amp; Creative Concepts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Bring creative ideas to events, activations, and content assets, from concept through to production files&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Design event materials across formats, from large-format banners and lightbox graphics to digital signage loops and giveaways&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Prepare print-ready artwork and work with print suppliers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;AI-Enabled Design&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
