&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Champion the voice of the customer by translating insights into product feedback that shapes the Mirakl Connect roadmap, while building a team culture grounded in ownership, experimentation, and results.&lt;/li&gt;
