&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot; data-start=&quot;3393&quot; data-end=&quot;3402&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.prolific.com/&quot;&gt;Website&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot; data-start=&quot;3404&quot; data-end=&quot;3413&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@JoinProlific&quot;&gt;Youtube&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot; data-start=&quot;3415&quot; data-end=&quot;3435&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Privacy Statement&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3437&quot; data-end=&quot;3863&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you agree that Prolific may collect your personal data for recruiting and global organisation planning. Prolific&#39;s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/prolific/Policy-Privacy-Notice-for-Candidates-f94a136a67544388b4888bc436451b57&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;explains what personal information Prolific may process, where Prolific may process your personal information, its purposes for processing your personal information, and the rights you can exercise over Prolific use of your personal personal information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Product Manager to own Pricing within our Growth team across Deliveroo and Wolt! This role operates across 40+ markets in EMEA, and sits at the heart of our marketplace: Our fee strategy directly shapes consumer conversion, order frequency, PnL outcomes - and connects deeply to rider earnings and merchant economics across the Globe. You&#39;ll be responsible for building a pricing strategy and experimentation roadmap that grows revenue and profitability sustainably, without compromising the customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a very high-visibility role. You&#39;ll partner closely with Leadership, Data Science, Engineering, Finance, Marketing, and Operations to design, launch, and iterate on pricing experiments across all markets, from delivery fee and service fee algorithms to 0-1 new ventures. You&#39;ll be expected to build a strong testing culture, translate ambiguous commercial questions into a rigorous experimentation agenda, and communicate results and trade-offs clearly to senior stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ambition is simple: make our platform an affordable, daily habit for all users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Pricing team builds the systems and experiences that touch every single order — from delivery options to promotions, fees, and entirely new pricing models. Operating across 40+ markets, our work sits at the intersection of customer value, growth, and marketplace economics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Small changes at this scale can change how customers perceive us, how often they order, and the economics of the entire marketplace. We bring together consumer psychology, experimentation, data science, economics, and product craft to answer one deceptively difficult question: &lt;strong&gt;How do we make every order feel like great value while driving sustainable growth?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end strategy and roadmap for a portfolio of global pricing products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and launch major growth opportunities across affordability, conversion, frequency, revenue, and profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive 0 to 1 big bets through validation, launch, then scale them 100X.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner deeply with Data Science and ML Engineering to design pricing algorithms, experiments, and scalable platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop hypotheses, launch experiments, interpret results, and turn learnings into product strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the metrics and decision frameworks used to evaluate customer value, growth, and marketplace economics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate strategy, results, and tradeoffs to senior leaders across DoorDash.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You might be a great fit if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have significant product management experience building complex consumer, marketplace, growth, or monetization products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are deeply analytical and comfortable using experimentation and data to make high-stakes product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable working closely with Data Science and ML Engineering on algorithmic or optimization problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can turn ambiguous commercial questions into clear and executable product hypotheses and roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can operate as a “conductor” — aligning technical, operational, and business stakeholders and stitching together strategy, execution, and influence across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo and Wolt, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 Solve meaningful problems at real scale Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 See your impact, fast Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 Grow through challenge and ownership Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 A culture built for builders High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 Share in the success you help create Competitive salary and equity options, so you’re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➡️ Want a deeper look at how we build? Check out our&lt;a href=&quot;https://deliveroo.engineering/&quot;&gt; Tech Blog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/how-we-hire/&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the Team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cx App Foundations is a platform organisation within our global Cx organisation. It provides shared consumer foundations and platform capabilities used by engineering teams across Wolt, DoorDash, and Deliveroo. Within this organisation, the Velocity team owns the paved road for consumer app development across mobile and web: shared SDKs and client foundations, integration patterns and multi-brand customisation, migration playbooks and reference implementations, and developer tooling that makes building on shared foundations fast and safe. Our mission is to reduce the cost, time, and risk of building consumer experiences across platforms and brands. Product teams own customer-facing experiences; our job is to make sure they can spend their time on delivering delightful experiences. The team is AI-native: AI is a default part of how we design, build, and ship software.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Engineering Manager, you will lead a team of experienced engineers across mobile and web, collaborating closely with product teams, design, and adjacent platform organisations across three brands. Your primary responsibility will be owning the team&#39;s roadmap and delivery of shared client foundations, and driving their adoption across the organisation, so that product teams ship delightful customer experiences without rebuilding the foundations under them. You will be a key player in keeping the team&#39;s operating model healthy: clear intake from stakeholders, predictable delivery, and support expectations that keep the platform from drifting into a general escalation queue. You will also guide architectural and system design decisions with your tech leads. You will stay hands-on: contributing code, reviews, and prototypes alongside the team is part of the job. This role is ideal for a leader who has run platforms, SDKs, or shared services for other engineering teams, communicates clearly across brands and time zones, and wants their impact measured through what other teams achieve with the foundations you ship.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You&#39;re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the platform roadmap - the shared SDKs, client foundations, and developer tooling the team ships - and sequence it against the migration and adoption goals of the three brands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption of the shared foundations by partnering with product teams, running onboarding and rollout support, and making the supported path the easiest path&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and grow experienced mobile and web engineers, keeping growth conversations, calibration, and feedback loops running&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep the team&#39;s operating model healthy: clear intake (stakeholder management, shared-platform, product-specific, or exception work), supported capabilities with entry criteria and support expectations, and predictable delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide architectural and system design decisions for client foundations that three brands and multiple app platforms depend on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay hands-on by contributing code and reviews alongside the team, and champion AI-native development practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow the team through hiring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our humble expectations&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 3+ years of experience managing engineers, including a team with senior engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a solid background (5+ years) in mobile or web engineering, with enough technical depth to hold your own in architecture discussions about client foundations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You use AI tooling fluently in your day-to-day work and stay close to the code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have run a platform, SDK, or shared service that other teams depend on, and know how to treat internal customers as customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work across boundaries naturally: product teams, design, other platform organisations, data/analytics and stakeholders in other locations and time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hold a high bar for engineering quality and can navigate production incidents and release tradeoffs with calm structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A platform leadership role with real leverage: the foundations the team owns shape how consumer experiences get built across Wolt, DoorDash, and Deliveroo, and your roadmap decisions multiply across every product team that builds on them.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The position will be filled as soon as we find the right person, so make sure to apply as soon as you realize you really, really want to join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The compensation will be a combination of monthly pay and DoorDash RSUs. The latter makes it exceptionally easy to be excited about our company growing and doing well, as you’ll own a piece of the pie.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;#LI-LW1&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ncz4s_oBczc&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Ripple, we’re building a world where value moves like information does today. It’s big, it’s bold, and we’re already doing it. Through our crypto solutions for financial institutions, businesses, governments and developers, we are improving the global financial system and creating greater economic fairness and opportunity for more people, in more places around the world. And we get to do the best work of our career and grow our skills surrounded by colleagues who have our backs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you’re ready to see your impact and unlock incredible career growth opportunities, join us, and build real world value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE WORK:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join the Ripple Treasury Payments team in London! We build the payment workflows clients use to create, approve and release payments in bank formats like ISO 20022. Ripple Treasury facilitates over $13 trillion in payments a year, for clients from small businesses to the Fortune 500. Every payment is value moving the way Ripple believes it should.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with C# / .NET 8, Azure, SQL Server, React and TypeScript, and help modernise a large .NET Framework codebase. AI tools are part of how we work every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of a core payment service within your first 6–12 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build and ship full-stack features across .NET 8 services and React front ends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead large projects from design to rollout with one or two other engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modernise legacy code, building in automated tests and observability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product, engineering and client support, and join our on-call rotation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers through code review and pairing, and help us hire&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL BRING:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4–8 years of professional software development experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong C# / .NET backend skills, including in large, established codebases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with React, TypeScript and SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily, hands-on use of AI coding assistants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A record of delivering projects to production with limited supervision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about payments: we’ll help you learn the domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Do Your Best Work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The opportunity to build in a fast-paced start-up environment with experienced industry leaders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A learning environment where you can dive deep into the latest technologies and make an impact.&amp;nbsp; A professional development budget to support other modes of learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Thrive in an environment where no matter what race, ethnicity, gender, origin, or culture they identify with, every employee is a respected, valued, and empowered part of the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In-office collaboration for moments that matter is important to our culture, and we give managers and teams the flexibility to decide which 10+ days a month they come in.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bi-weekly all-company meeting - business updates and ask me anything style discussion with our Leadership Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We come together for moments that matter which include team offsites, team bonding activities, happy hours and more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Control of Your Finances&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, bonuses, and equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive benefits that cover physical and mental healthcare, retirement, family forming, and family support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Employee giving match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Mobile phone stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Care of Yourself&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;R&amp;amp;R days so you can rest and recharge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous wellness reimbursement and weekly onsite &amp;amp; virtual programming&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous vacation policy - work with your manager to take time off when you need it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Industry-leading parental leave policies. Family planning benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Catered lunches, fully-stocked kitchens with premium snacks/beverages, and plenty of fun events&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Benefits listed above are for full-time employees.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
