&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We encourage you to apply even if you don&#39;t meet every point above. We care more about what you&#39;ve broken, and how, than about certifications or job titles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:78,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:78}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
